    "Installing Steam": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在安装 Steam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam will be installed automatically behind the progress screen on the first launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次启动将在进度界面后自动安装 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missing components are prepared first. If Steam.exe exists in the client folder, it starts with compatibility options. Otherwise setup runs behind the progress screen, closes, and Steam starts in the same session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先准备缺失的组件。客户端目录中已有 Steam.exe 时，会带兼容参数直接启动；否则在进度界面后安装，关闭安装程序后，在同一会话中启动 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The official installer is included. Setup automatically selects Next twice, Install, then Finish when the expected pages appear. Keep the suggested folder. Unknown pages remain available for manual input.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
