    "The ring completes one cycle every 5 seconds. Green means the latest probe returned 42; red means untested, unavailable, failed or stale. Animation alone does not prove JIT is working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外圈每 5 秒完成一轮。绿色表示最近探测返回 42；红色表示尚未探测、不可用、失败或结果过期。转圈本身不代表 JIT 正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The probe reuses a separate 16 KiB buffer, wipes its code each round and releases its mappings before Steam starts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
