            "value": "Steam 安装程序目录必须位于 Madeira 的 drive_c 内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The official Windows installer is included. It needs an internet connection to download the Steam client. Complete installation in the Wine desktop, keeping the suggested folder, then return here to start Steam.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已内置官方 Windows 安装程序，安装时需要联网下载 Steam 客户端。请在 Wine 桌面中保留建议的目录并完成安装，再回到这里启动 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam client folder": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
