    ".data GLOBAL, not an IAT — the IAT-restricted pass finds nothing and the same VA keeps costing one Mach exception per Metal call (118K+ observed; handler saturation = the desktop \"freezes\"). When the IAT pass strikes out, scan each copy'...": {
      "localizations": {
