      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0 (default): no limit. N: a reservation larger than N MB is backed by the swap file only, never by the donor pool (a test; a game's own big heap is usually hot and runs faster in donor RAM). Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过指定 MB 的区域仅使用交换文件；0 不限制。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0 (default): off. N: Social Club's SocialClubHelper.exe and Steam's steamwebhelper.exe see at most N MB of available physical memory, nobody else (the game and the launcher keep the real figure). Below 400 (e.g. 300) Chromium reports critical memory pressure every 5 s and purges caches and garbage; 400-999 (e.g. 900), moderate every 10 s. Independent of avail-phys. Set it in the game's own file; read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅限制浏览器辅助程序看到的可用内存，单位 MB；0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0 fails the load of an image whose shared writable section is not aligned to the host page, as before; otherwise that section is mapped private.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未按宿主页对齐的可写共享段改为私有映射；0 拒绝加载。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0 keeps the executable window from a fixed-base (relocations stripped) image smaller than 64 MB, as before; such a program then fails to start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许固定地址的小型映像使用可执行窗口。"
