    "0: no \\\\.\\\\PhysicalDrive0 (the prefix disk's capacity)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向游戏提供虚拟物理磁盘容量信息，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: no frame-time marks; the overlay's graph and 1% cells stay empty": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录每帧耗时；0 使浮层图表与百分位帧率为空。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: no local answer to zero-timeout polls": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许零超时轮询在本地返回结果。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: no per-game choice, every start runs what is pending": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示每个游戏的首次运行组件安装选项。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: no spatial audio (a game falls back to a plain stream); unset or 1: Wine's spatial audio, as before": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制空间音频：0 关闭，默认使用 Wine 空间音频。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: one wake signal per request, as before": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合并服务器唤醒请求，0 每个请求单独唤醒。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: other programs' views may be placed inside a 32-bit guest window or its placeholder again (default 1: only the window's own process maps there)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 位窗口仅允许其所属进程映射，默认启用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: read every client fd on every pass, as before": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以通知机制唤醒服务器，0 每轮扫描全部客户端。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: shaders converted without D3D12's robust buffer access (bounds check), as env MADEIRA_IR_NO_BOUNDS_CHECK=1": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时关闭 D3D12 着色器缓冲区边界检查。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: such a session runs Wine's standard sync, as before 2026-10-28": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时，为需要服务管理器的 Dock 会话使用 Wine 标准同步。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: the host follows the installers in the same session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将首次组件安装与游戏放在独立会话中；0 使用同一会话。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: the in-game menu's solid panel, as before 2026-10-28": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时游戏菜单使用纯色面板。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: the install scripts' Registry values are not written": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用安装脚本中的注册表值；0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: the starting screen does not watch the host's result": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动画面跟踪 Dock 的运行结果；0 不跟踪。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: the starting screen fades in without growing out of the Play button": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时启动画面仅淡入，不使用从按钮展开的动画。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: the starting screen is one centred column in landscape too": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时横屏启动画面也采用居中的单列布局。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "0: while a Dock start's census runs, a window first shown minimized stays minimized": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复首次显示即最小化的启动窗口。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 (default): an image whose .data was shifted to a 16 KB page gets its x18 trampolines on the page after it, not on its last .data page (mapped without exec). 0: the old offsets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "避免跳板落在不可执行的数据页面，默认启用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 (default): zero-size textures refused with E_INVALIDARG; 0: passed to Metal, which aborts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拒绝零尺寸纹理，默认启用，避免 Metal 中止进程。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 (the app): the session's title is 64-bit, its 32-bit programs helpers; donor RAM first beside them": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标识本会话主游戏为 64 位，使其优先使用共享 RAM。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 = VirtualLock (mlock) default-buffer-swap's storage so its pages stay resident; 0 = pageable (as before)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将默认缓冲区交换存储锁定在物理内存中；0 允许换页。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 config line": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 行配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 game setting": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 项游戏设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 item installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 1 个项目"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 item to download": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待下载 1 个项目"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 launch switch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 个启动开关"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 logs up to 64 successful 1–16 byte executable-image protection requests and their PE/pool bytes. Read-only, owner-aware diagnostics; does not alter hooks or code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录有限次数的可执行映像保护请求及字节内容，不修改代码。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 puts the existing image slot below the native hole; 0/default keeps it above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将大型映像槽放在原生地址空洞下方，默认放在上方。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 秒"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 selects madsync (Settings > Sync engine > Madsync). Unset: fastsync, the default engine; 0 without env.MADEIRA_FASTSYNC: Wine standard sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 使用 madsync；未指定时使用 Fastsync，0 可选择 Wine 标准同步。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1 settings file": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 个设置文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 unread, 0 off, 1 on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制稀疏内存预留。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1% lows: the frame rate of the slowest 1% of frames in the last ten seconds; 1% highs, the fastest. The graph shows each frame's time, newest on the right; a stall is a plateau as long as the stall.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1% 低帧：最近十秒中最慢的 1% 帧的帧率；1% 高帧则对应最快的 1%。图表显示每帧耗时，最新帧位于右侧；卡顿会形成与持续时间等长的平台。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1. TARGETING. Arming the whole 1.2MB bitmap spreads a 400-attribution budget across ~76 pages, so the clear (which touches EVERY page first) dominates and the content painters — the writers that would name a displaced band — stay invisib...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限定表面写入监视的行范围。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1.5x": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.5 倍"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "100 ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "100 毫秒"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "150 ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "150 毫秒"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: Apple's Metal HUD only on the largest shown desktop window's Metal layer (its main layer), off on the other layers; default: Apple's own choice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在最大的可见桌面窗口显示 Metal 性能浮层。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: D3DKMTEnumAdapters2 lists the GPU DXGI and D3D12 report (same LUID) and D3DKMTQueryAdapterInfo answers like a WDDM 3.1 driver (driver version, caps, device ids, memory, performance data). Off (default): no adapter is listed, as before. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告与 DXGI 一致的显卡身份及 WDDM 3.1 能力。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: DXGI names NVIDIA as the vendor, DXMT's NVAPI answers and win32u registers the display adapter as a GeForce RTX 3060 (driver 581.57). Per game: Game details > Report an NVIDIA GPU, which also sets the matching DXGI device id.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将显卡身份报告为 GeForce RTX 3060，并启用 NVAPI；也可为单个游戏设置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: QueryWorkingSetEx's Valid bit from mincore() (iOS has no /proc pagemap); unset/0: every page reads as not resident, as before": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用系统驻留查询回答工作集页面是否在内存中。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: Wine boots with the emulator's arena at 0x7d00000000 (12 GB instead of 16 GB) and keeps 0x7c00000000 +4 GB free, so SocialClubHelper.exe's 32 GB PartitionAlloc reservation, which must start on a 32 GB boundary, gets 0x7800000000 (20 GB of it really reserved). 2: also libcef.dll's (0x7000000000) and Oilpan's; the JIT pool's RW alias moves to 0x7900000000. Off by default; set it in the game's own file; read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整浏览器与模拟器地址布局，以容纳大型对齐预留。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: Wine's service manager in every Dock game session, 0: never; unset: only when the prefix registers an automatic-start service outside Windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制 Dock 游戏会话是否启动 Windows 服务管理器。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: [swap] heat census of re-read swap extents; 2: plus new blocks of re-read sizes stay anonymous while the footprint has room; unset/0: off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "统计交换区域重复读取；模式 2 可将热点新分配留在 RAM。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: a free run below the 0x140000000 executable window (less pool-low-margin) becomes a third debugger region for the emulator's code buffers, so the whole JIT pool is left to DLL copies (GTA V: about 300 MB more). Needs the pool above the window; costs the region's size in memory. Off by default; read at launch, the game's own file wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用下方空闲区域，让主要 JIT 池保留给 DLL 副本。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: a full FEX arena adds a FEX_ONLY band below it (default off: on the Social Club layout a band lies in address space the browser helper's allocators were granted, and their writes corrupted it); default: the request fails as before": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FEX 区域耗尽后尝试增加新区域，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: consoles keep their conhost window (default: none, as with CREATE_NO_WINDOW)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为控制台程序保留可见窗口，默认隐藏。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: decode BC uploads (no native BC), 0: raw copies": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制 BC 压缩纹理上传解码：1 解码，0 原样复制。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: every 5 s a [power] line next to [xp]'s CPU energy: the GPU energy and time the driver charged to the app's coalition, the SoC's Energy Model counters (IOReport) and the battery's voltage and current (the whole device while unplugged), each source named unavailable once when the system gives nothing; and [power-t], the threads that used the most energy. Off (default): nothing is read. Needs the [xp] sampler. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。记录 GPU 能耗、系统能耗计数、电池信息和高耗能线程。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: list modes up to 4x the session default's pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列出最多四倍默认像素数的显示模式。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: load d3d12core.dll (Agility SDK layout); >1: also its D3D12SDKVersion": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加载 d3d12core.dll；大于 1 时同时查询其 SDK 版本。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: never ask mprotect for PROT_EXEC; every executable request takes the JIT-pool path, as on a TXM device. For iOS 18 and iOS 26 devices without TXM, where it would succeed in place. Default off: as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有可执行内存请求均经过 JIT 池，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: notify the foreground thread on every ClipCursor, as before": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次指针裁剪变化均通知前台线程。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: on iPhone, pointer interactions attach their drivers as on iPad, so hover from the AssistiveTouch cursor reaches the game view": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上启用类似 iPad 的鼠标悬停交互。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: report 8x MSAA (rendered at 4x)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告支持 8 倍 MSAA，实际使用 4 倍渲染。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: report window lineage to the desktop compositor (off by default; this app's hook is a stub)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向桌面合成器报告窗口来源关系。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: semaphores use cells too (off by default)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "信号量也使用快速同步单元，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: the Direct3D 12 runtime's log lines skip OutputDebugString (an exception and a server request each, ~0.5 ms a line on the device) and reach the log through Wine's own debug output and stderr only; the census frames between presents 1500 and 3000 and the list 12000-12400 draw dumps are off (each froze the game for 1-2 s); the per-shader \"converted at runtime\" line is kept for the first 64 shaders and then every 1000th. A manual frame capture still works. Default off: the logging as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过昂贵的 OutputDebugString 路径及统计帧，降低诊断开销。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: the FPS readouts count hidden windows' presents too (as before 2026-10-26)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帧率统计包含隐藏窗口，默认不计入。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: the JIT-pool warmer (page warming and the periodic memory walks) and the stale-pointer healer run at utility QoS, on the efficiency cores, ECO on or off; neither does work a frame waits for. The wineserver thread, the exception thread, audio and the interface keep their QoS. Off (default): they keep the QoS they were created with. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让内存预热和旧指针修复线程使用较低服务质量。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: the Wine server takes the path of a file it has just opened from its descriptor (fcntl F_GETPATH) instead of realpath, which checks the path one folder at a time (~0.5 ms a file on the device). Same resolved path; realpath stays the fallback. For games that open many files a second (Horizon Zero Dawn's shader cache in its menu). Off (default): realpath as before. Read at each launch; a later game of the same app run does not inherit it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用文件描述符取得路径，减少逐层目录查询。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: the app runs with the iPad interface idiom on iPhone, so pointer lock is requested (Madeira's screens use iPad layouts)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上使用 iPad 界面模式，以请求指针锁定。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: the archive folder sits in the build's shader cache directory and goes with it when a new build prunes it (the first version). Off: Madeira/PipelineArchive in LOCALAPPDATA, kept across builds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后归档随构建缓存清理；关闭时跨构建保留。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: the samplers that suspend threads stop ([thread-sample] bursts every 20 s, the guest RIP profile behind [rip-profile] and [cpu-split], [wprof]); the warmer's address-space walks ([phys-map], slot and window inventory) run every ~10 min instead of every minute, its zone check and allocation probe every minute instead of every 2 s; mprotect_exec's per-call ERR line is kept for the first 200 calls, then every 1000th. [xp], [xp-t], [xp-api] and [sync-census] keep their rates. Off (default): every diagnostic as before. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "减少暂停线程的采样与地址扫描频率，以降低诊断对性能的影响。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: touches always reach the program as a mouse, 0: never; default: not while touch controller mappings are shown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触摸转鼠标：1 始终启用，0 始终关闭；默认在显示触控手柄时关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: under eco, a thread that raises itself to TIME_CRITICAL keeps user-interactive QoS; 2: HIGHEST and above; unset/0: off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "节能模式下为高优先级线程保留交互级服务质量。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: when the guest band is exhausted, hand the unclaimed 8 GB V8 cage holdback to it. Set by the app for a Madeira Dock session; off otherwise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "客户机地址不足时释放未使用的 8 GB V8 预留区域。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: when the pool would shrink below its size (pool, 896 MB by default) because the main thread's stack splits the only executable band, the free run above the stack becomes a second debugger region and both form one pool (about 880 MB instead of 560-630 MB). Costs the second region's size in memory. Off by default; read at launch, the game's own file wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用栈两侧的空位，尽量达到所请求的池大小。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: with env.MADEIRA_PAD_MODE = hid, a pad that is not a PlayStation one becomes a generic HID gamepad and leaves XInput (the old behaviour). Off: it stays on XInput.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HID 模式下将非 PlayStation 手柄转换为通用 HID；关闭时仍使用 XInput。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: with the HID controller on, player 1 also stays an XInput pad. Off by default, so a game that reads both APIs does not see the same pad twice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭，避免同一手柄在游戏中重复出现。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "1: write Documents/fex-jit-dump.bin (the JIT pool, sparse) on the first mach UNHANDLED / SIGILL (ml1242); default 0.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次未处理异常时导出 JIT 池，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "2 s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 秒"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "2 selects broad swap coverage (ml1257) when env.MADEIRA_SWAP_COVERAGE is unset; any other value, classic. The coverage key wins when set.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 表示广泛覆盖，其他值使用传统大块模式；明确覆盖设置优先。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "200 ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "200 毫秒"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "2: format queries too": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录 D3D12 能力查询；2 同时记录格式查询。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "2x": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 倍"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "3. runs MetalFX's frame interpolator (MTLFXFrameInterpolator, iOS 26) on the two frames, that motion field and a flat depth, 4. presents the generated frame at once and the real one half a frame later (presentDrawable:atTime:). The panel...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 MetalFX 在相邻真实帧之间生成插值帧。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "300 ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "300 毫秒"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "32-bit GL query results as buffer offsets": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 位 GL 查询使用缓冲区偏移"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "32-bit emulator module runs from its JIT-pool copy only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 位模拟器仅执行 JIT 副本"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "32-bit installer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 位安装程序"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "32-bit programs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 位程序"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "32-bit thread group affinity": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 位线程组亲和性"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "32-bit windows: judge a merged area by the request": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按请求判断合并的 32 位地址区"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "4 s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 秒"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "400 files into C:\\madeira-cs on every run cost startup time for a diagnostic that is only wanted while chasing one kernel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出计算着色器，可能增加启动耗时。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "48 to 256 MB of image headroom in the FEX pool-tail budget; 48/default keeps the existing policy. Region C is unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在代码池尾部预算中为映像预留 48–256 MB 空间。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "60 ms (default)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "60 毫秒（默认）"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "64-bit JIT without the call-return shadow stack": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "64 位 JIT 省略调用返回影子栈"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "8 s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8 秒"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "; automatic upload is also on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "；自动上传也已开启"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A Dock session publishes no fixed Steam game identity to its guests (WineProcessBridge.m): Valve's client runs in the host and gives each game its own. Every other launch clears the flag and is unchanged. env.MADEIRA_DOCK_CLEAR_STEAM_ID ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dock 会话由 Steam 为各游戏提供身份，不发布固定的 Steam 游戏身份。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A GOG download could not be unpacked (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解压 GOG 下载内容（%@）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A Madeira switch (util_madeira_switch.hpp): the i386 build uses the address wait by default; every 64-bit build keeps std::atomic, which is upstream behaviour, unless DXMT_WAIT_ON_ADDRESS is set. Only the non-upstream choice is logged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用地址等待机制，默认仅在 32 位构建启用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A Steam Cloud file could not be unpacked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解压 Steam 云文件。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A Steam Cloud file did not match its checksum.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 云文件校验失败。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A beta build: it can be unstable, and its saves may not work on the public build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试版本可能不稳定，其存档也可能无法在公开版本中使用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A cloud save path contains a symbolic link; nothing was changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云存档路径包含符号链接，未进行任何修改。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A cloud save path leaves the save folder; nothing was changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云存档路径超出存档文件夹，未进行任何修改。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A default keyed event per process": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个进程独立的默认键控事件"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A downloaded %@ could not be decompressed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解压下载的 %@。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A downloaded %@ could not be decrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解密下载的 %@。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A downloaded %@ failed its checksum.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的 %@ 校验失败。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A downloaded part failed its checksum.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的分块校验失败。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A downloaded save file failed its check; nothing was changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的存档校验失败，未进行任何修改。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A draw's declarations count only once its chain has been encoded: a draw that returns early leaves them uncommitted, and the next begin drops them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在绘制成功编码后提交资源使用声明，避免提前退出留下无效状态。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A dxvk.conf to read instead of the one in the program's working folder (a Windows path, e.g. C:\\users\\madeira\\dxvk.conf); with d3d11 = dxvk. See DXVK's dxvk.conf for the options.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定 Windows 路径，替代程序工作目录中的 dxvk.conf。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A fault storm in a helper program ends only that program": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助进程故障时仅结束该进程"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A file from GOG failed its checksum (%@). Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GOG 文件校验失败（%@），请重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A game cannot be closed from Madeira, so its saves otherwise reach the cloud only at the next app start. The session menu's \"Upload saves and close Madeira\" sends them now: the app takes the account back from the session's client, upload...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提供上传存档并关闭 Madeira 的菜单操作。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A game file could not be downloaded from EA (%@). Try again to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法从 EA 下载游戏文件（%@）。请重试以继续。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A game file could not be downloaded from Epic (%@). Try again to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法从 Epic 下载游戏文件（%@）。请重试以继续。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A game file could not be downloaded from GOG (%@). Try again to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法从 GOG 下载游戏文件（%@）。请重试以继续。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A launcher -> helper -> program chain needs a THIRD window. After the carve, finish the held upper half of the cage, [0x7300000000, 0x73ffff0000), on demand. The missing 64 KB and the guard are acquired together with tryfixed, which refu...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按需为额外的 32 位子进程分配第三个地址窗口。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A launcher stub that starts the game and exits at once (GTA V Enhanced: PlayGTAV.exe -> GTA5_Enhanced.exe) must not end the session -- stopping the wineserver here killed the game while it loaded. If a child process that is not a crash r...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动器退出后继续等待其游戏子进程，避免提前结束会话。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A network error occurred (%@). Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发生网络错误（%@），请重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A number that can have a decimal point.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可包含小数点的数字。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A process without the extended-virtual-addressing entitlement has a map that ends at 0xfc0000000 (63 GB). The 0x7000000000 hint is past its end, and an ANYWHERE search that starts past the end of the map does not wrap: every alias failed...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读写别名映射失败后在实际地址空间范围内重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A protection change between two deliveries (FEX's self-modifying-code cycle: unprotect, recompile, protect again) is real progress. Tag redeliv_guest_rip with the protection sequence number so the consecutive counter below starts a new r...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将内存保护变化视为异常重试期间的实际进展。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A run of breakpoints at different addresses is not a stuck thread": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不同地址的断点不算卡死"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "A save chunk is larger than 1 MiB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
