    "Donor pool free-RAM margin (MB)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享内存池空闲内存余量"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Donor pool gives the swap tier RAM that does not count against Madeira's memory limit: memory donated by Madeira's helper extension, which creates it, hands it over and exits, used before the swap file while the phone has memory to spare. It stops taking more when iOS reports memory pressure. Experimental; needs the swap tier on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享内存池为交换层提供不计入 Madeira 内存上限的 RAM：辅助扩展创建内存、交给主应用后退出；设备内存充足时，会先使用这部分内存，再使用交换文件。iOS 报告内存压力时停止申请。此功能为实验性质，需要启用交换层。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Donor pool memory kind": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共享内存类型"
          }
        }
