    "EXECUTE from max_protection for good (ml140), so every later hand-out there was born non-executable: device logs 80-83 show [pool-poison] starting exactly at such an image's allocation end, after which every process started later in the ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按段边界限制保护范围，避免使后续池页面永久失去执行权限。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Eco QoS class": {
