          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Empty by default: every thread stack is at least 8 MB (Chromium needs that). Exe names, separated by commas (e.g. RDR2.exe): threads of these programs get the stack they ask for, at least 2 MB, so their stacks take less of the shared memory space. Never list Chromium programs (SocialClubHelper.exe, Launcher.exe, steamwebhelper.exe). Read when a thread starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用逗号分隔程序名，允许其使用至少 2 MB 的栈，其他程序至少 8 MB。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
