    "Env-gated metallib dump: point DXMT_AIRCONV_DUMP at a directory and every DXSOCompile call drops a {kind}_{hash}.metallib there. Disassemble with `xcrun air-objdump -d <file>` to inspect what AGX actually receives. Only meant for triage ...": {
