          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Experiment, default 0. 10 or 11 reports DXR tier 1.0 or 1.1 in OPTIONS5 although the runtime has no ray tracing (its calls stay unimplemented stubs, logged once). Only for finding out whether a game's device check wants it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
