    "FEX's Mono backpatcher bridge (ml712). On by itself for Wine Mono, 32- and 64-bit (ml1282/ml1286); for the 32-bit runtime in a guest window it also turns SMC detection off once the backpatcher is found (ml1280). 0 keeps it off.": {
