    "Fastsync is the default engine: with neither this nor inproc-sync set, the app exports auto. Settings > Sync engine > Fastsync removes both keys. Never runs while madsync is on. auto arms the fast wake path on heavy event traffic, 1 from the start, cells only answers polls, 0 is off.": {
