    "GOG's server answered with HTTP %@. Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GOG 服务器返回 HTTP %@，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Galaxy reply of %@ bytes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Galaxy 响应为 %@ 字节"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Game language: the language Steam downloads install, and the one Steam tells the game to use. A game without it gets English. Installed games keep their language until you choose Download in their page.\n\nDownloads from PCs on this network: a game's download comes first from a PC on the same network whose Steam has it installed and up to date, through Steam's local network game transfers (Steam on the PC: same account, Settings › Downloads › Game file transfer over local network on, no download or game running). Anything the PC does not have comes from Steam's servers. Madeira finds the PC through Steam and shows up in the account's devices as \"Madeira\". PC address: only when the PC is not found; its IP address on this network.\n\nMadeira keeps a Steam sign-in token in this device's Keychain, for this device only. Signing out removes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏语言：Steam 下载内容及告知游戏使用的语言。游戏不支持所选语言时使用英语。已安装游戏会保留原语言，直到你在游戏详情中选择“下载”。\n\n从局域网电脑下载：优先从同一网络中已安装且更新此游戏的电脑传输文件。电脑上的 Steam 需登录同一账号，在“设置 › 下载”中启用“通过本地网络传输游戏文件”，并且没有正在运行的游戏或下载。缺少的文件从 Steam 服务器下载。Madeira 通过 Steam 查找电脑，在账号的设备列表中显示为 Madeira。仅在无法找到电脑时，才需填写其局域网 IP 地址。\n\nMadeira 将 Steam 登录令牌保存在此设备的钥匙串中，仅供本设备使用。退出登录会删除令牌。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Game sound in the background": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台游戏声音"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Game volume at the output (%)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏输出音量"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Game-mode windows. Outside desktop mode a window got win32u's offscreen surface and its position never reached the app, so a launcher or a message box a game opens before (or instead of) its 3D window was drawn nowhere: a game's Play / O...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为游戏创建并管理真实窗口，以显示启动器与消息框。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Games download directly from EA with your account into C:\\Program Files\\EA Games. Keep Madeira open while it downloads: in the background iOS allows only a short time, then the download pauses and continues when you return. A download also pauses while a game is running. Games with EA's anti-cheat (Battlefield 2042 and later, EA SPORTS FC) cannot run in Madeira.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用你的账号直接从 EA 下载游戏至 C:\\Program Files\\EA Games。下载时请保持 Madeira 在前台；进入后台一段时间后，iOS 会暂停下载，返回时继续。游戏运行期间也会暂停下载。使用 EA 反作弊的游戏（如《战地 2042》及后续作品、EA SPORTS FC）无法在 Madeira 中运行。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Games go back to Wine's own C++ runtime (and the copy bundled with this build, if any) at their next start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次启动游戏时将恢复使用 Wine 自带的 C++ 运行库，以及此构建可能包含的版本。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
