      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Glass is the system's Liquid Glass. Solid draws each button as a plain opaque disc; a game's Opacity slider still fades them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "玻璃样式使用系统的液态玻璃效果。纯色样式将按钮绘制为不透明圆盘；游戏的不透明度滑块仍可调整其透明程度。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Graph span": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图表时间范围"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Guest windows are reserved lazily; this reserves nothing unless a 32-bit main image was published or MADEIRA_WOW_PLACEHOLDERS=1 (see ios_wow_session_start). Last, after the holdback, whose first page the lowest slot borrows as its guard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按线程环境块查找 32 位客户机窗口。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "HID mode: keep player 1 on XInput too": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HID 模式同时保留 XInput"
