    "Healing default-ON since 2026-07-07: the patcher now rewrites ONLY IAT/delay-IAT slots (parsed from each pool copy's PE headers), so the 2026-07-04 breakage class — arm64x metadata slots whose consumers need PE VAs for identity/range com...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "禁用导入地址修复；默认仅修复 IAT 和延迟 IAT 槽。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Heuristic: x86_64 guest exes (cube-x64, hello-x64, real games like Thumper) need the arm64ec-windows bundle (ARM64EC hybrid system DLLs that interop with FEX-translated x86_64 code). ARM64-native tests (cube.exe) use the aarch64-windows ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按游戏架构选择 ARM64EC 或原生 ARM64 Windows 运行组件。"
