    "Host-only: lets the offline round-trip test point at the converter in the extracted package. Compiled out of the device build entirely, so the shipping runtime has exactly one place it will load the converter from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅供主机离线测试指定转换器动态库，设备构建不使用此选项。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "How long a released 1-16 MB guest allocation stays mapped before it is really freed (default 0: freed at once; 2000 ms is the tested hold).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "延迟真正释放 1–16 MB 分配的时间，单位毫秒；默认立即释放。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "How long a remembered listing is used without checking the directory, while no file was created, renamed, linked or deleted through Wine. After that one stat of the directory decides whether it is read again. 0 checks it on every lookup. Read once per app run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定无需重新查询目录的毫秒数，文件变更会提前使缓存失效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "How much sound Madeira keeps queued ahead of the speaker (10-500 ms, default 60). If a game's sound crackles or sounds scratchy, a larger buffer usually clears it, at the cost of sound lagging slightly behind the picture: Black Ops II's Zombies crackled at 60 ms and was clean at 150. A game's own config can set it for that game alone. Applies at the next game start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预先缓存的音频时长，范围 10–500 毫秒，默认 60。增大可减少杂音，但会增加声音延迟。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "IO_STATUS_BLOCK32 one guest window iOS maps nothing below 4 GB": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "避免向已退出的 32 位目标写入 I/O 状态。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "IV derivation failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法生成初始化向量：%@"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "If its window no longer changes, it may have finished without closing. Ending the session leaves it unrecorded; Record as done under One-time installs records it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果安装窗口长时间不再变化，可能已完成但未自动关闭。结束会话不会记录为已完成；可以在“首次运行组件”中选择“标记为已完成”。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "If the page shows an address that ends in login_successful.html with a code, copy that whole address and paste it here.": {
      "localizations": {
