        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缺少安装文件："
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Installers and launchers that show web pages use Wine Gecko, the Wine project's open-source HTML engine. Madeira gets it from WineHQ by itself on Wi-Fi, so Wine never stops to download it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要显示网页的安装程序和启动器使用 Wine Gecko，这是 Wine 项目的开源 HTML 引擎。Madeira 会在 Wi-Fi 下自动从 WineHQ 下载，避免 Wine 中途停下来请求下载。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Installers expect a service manager, and a Dock session starts none before the host. With madsync, Wine's services.exe never answered its RPC clients in the fork's device runs, so the service step and then every installer waited; msiexec...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为首次组件安装启动 Windows 服务管理器。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Installing it on this device…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在此设备上安装…"
