          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Interpreted V8 costs 5-20x on all of Steam's UI JavaScript, so this is the largest single startup lever we have. MADEIRA_JITLESS=0 turns it off; default stays ON (unchanged). ml2230 (device logs 111-112, Big Picture): CEF's verbose file ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "禁用浏览器 V8 JIT，默认启用；关闭可能影响兼容性。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
