    },
    "Keep this device's version of %@? Saves that differ replace Steam Cloud's for every device; the cloud's copies are saved first, in Files › Madeira › Steam Cloud Backups. Saves missing on this device stay missing, and Steam Cloud keeps them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留此设备上的 %@ 版本？不同的存档将替换所有设备使用的 Steam 云版本，替换前会将云端副本备份到“文件 › Madeira › Steam Cloud Backups”。本机缺失的存档仍然缺失，云端会继续保留。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Kill switch, default 0: a file's descriptor comes back in the server's get_handle_fd reply (a copy the server makes; it shares this process's descriptor table), the same descriptor without a sendmsg, a recvmsg, an fcntl and two server log lines per file. 1: through the process socket, as before. Read once per app run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制服务器返回文件句柄的路径，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Kill switch, default 0: a file's size, index or end-of-file query (GetFileSizeEx and the like) is answered from one fstat; the two extended-attribute reads that came after it fed only file attributes, which these queries do not return. 1: as before. Read once per app run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复用一次文件查询结果，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Kill switch, default 0: the Wine server's add_poll_user and send_client_fd log lines (one per opened file or descriptor sent, each a formatted write to the log file on the server thread) are written for their first 64 and then every 1000th; a failed send is always written. 1: every line, as before. Read at each launch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭，详细日志可能影响性能。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Kill switch, default 1: a file name that does not match in its exact case is looked up in an in-memory copy of its directory instead of a volume query and a directory read each time (twice when the name is absent). Source-engine games such as Team Fortress 2 probe thousands of absent paths while loading and during play. 0: as before. Read once per app run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对大小写不完全匹配的文件查找复用内存目录，提高文件查找速度。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Kill switch, read once: 0 turns the check off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查纯 IL 程序的 WoW64 运行方式，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
