    "Load OSMesa and prove Zink actually runs: a throwaway core-profile context must report the Zink renderer. Mesa quietly falls back to softpipe when Zink cannot start (no MoltenVK, missing Vulkan features), and a software rasterizer is not...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
