    },
    "Logging for Steam sign-in. `event` lines are the always-on, low-volume record ([steam-signin]). They never contain tokens, passwords, Steam Guard codes, account names, Steam IDs or message payloads. `trace` lines are protocol-level detai...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用 Steam 登录跟踪；常规事件不记录密码、令牌或账号身份。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视角"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Looking over the game's files…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查游戏文件…"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA (ml1190): DXMT_CLEAR_DISCARD_STORE is a Madeira switch (util_madeira_switch.hpp), on by default only in the i386 build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按清除和丢弃语义省略存储，默认仅在 32 位构建启用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA (ml1190): opt-in diagnostics, DXMT_DISPLAY_MODE_STATS=1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录显示模式诊断。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA (ml1490): with DXMT_ZERO_BUFFER_POW2, grow to the next power of two (at least 1 MB) instead of the exact request. Each growth costs a flushInternal(), and a loading screen asking for slowly rising sizes regrew the buffer 322 time...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "零缓冲区按 2 的幂增长，以减少重复刷新和分配。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA: CodeInvalidationMutex is not recursive. When this thread already write-owns it, a second exclusive lock parks the thread behind itself, and every other thread queues behind it for good (log 56: one thread waiting on the lock it ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "避免已持有代码失效锁的线程再次锁定自身。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA: StrictInProcessSplitLocks defaults ON for 32-bit guests. * An x86 LOCK op on a word that crosses a 16-byte boundary faults on this host and FEX emulates it as two separate half-width CASes. Without the strict mode two threads do...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "严格处理跨边界原子锁操作，默认对 32 位程序启用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA: hot SMC pages (InvalidationTracker::EnableHotSMCPages). MADEIRA_SMC_HOT_PAGE: unset = 64 write faults within a second, 0 = off (every write to a code page invalidates it), N = threshold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "识别频繁改写的代码页，调整翻译失效策略；0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA: rate-limit the call-ret reset that follows a code invalidation. * On the iOS host nothing reads the stack's contents: the RET shortcut (BranchOps.cpp, ml305) and the EnterEC return (Dispatcher.cpp) are compiled out, so a skipped...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限制代码失效后的调用返回状态重置频率。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA: the 64-bit (ARM64EC) build is the x64 programs' d3d9.dll, in place of Wine's, which needs OpenGL and so always failed to create here. MADEIRA_D3D9_X64=0 makes creation fail the same way again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让 64 位程序使用 ARM64EC Direct3D 9 实现；0 禁用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA: winegstreamer's unix side is bound for 32-bit (wow64) callers, and for 64-bit (ARM64EC) ones too: without it an x64 program's xWMA voices (FAudio's WMA decoder DMO, wmadmod -> winegstreamer) decode to silence. A 64-bit caller ge...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 64 位程序连接 Wine 媒体解码实现。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_CPU_COUNT, a per-launch setting the app exports for one program, wins over the global key; unset = the key's behaviour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由应用为单次启动设置 CPU 核心数，优先于全局设置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_CTX_FP=0: a cross-thread GetThreadContext returns zeroed vector registers, as before. madeira.cfg (and the game's own lines) are read first: this server starts before the app exports env.* lines (ml1236) and runs again for the ne...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跨线程上下文查询提供浮点和向量寄存器，0 返回零。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_DEFER_SECTION_ABORT=0: a killed thread exits at once, even inside a section": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在临界区域内延迟线程终止，0 立即退出。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_DIAG=1 lifts the cap; read once. Local to this file so the media unix side links against nothing but upstream's libntdll_unix.a.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提高媒体诊断日志上限。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_DIRECT_CURSOR=0: no cursor is drawn on the game view, motion stays relative there and the pointer never locks by itself; the driver reports nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接游戏视图中绘制鼠标并支持指针锁定，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_DIRECT_WINDOW_SIZE=1: keep an opted-in presenting window's client at the selected resolution, including an engine resize after startup. Default off; desktop sessions and ordinary windowed games are unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持游戏窗口客户区为选定分辨率，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_EXT_PROBE=1: at session start the JIT helper extension reports the address space and memory limit its own process gets (ml1310 feasibility probe for extension processes)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动时探测 JIT 辅助扩展的地址空间与内存限制。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_FEX_FAIL_CALLRET=threadstate:N fails the Nth thread-state allocation, so this containment path can be proven rather than assumed -- it only occurs naturally once the band is exhausted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注入线程状态或调用返回分配失败，供异常处理测试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_FREE_DELAY_REUSE=0: a reservation over held releases fails until the delay runs out, as before; default 1: those held ranges are freed at once": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址复用时提前释放延迟回收区域，避免无谓等待。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_FRONTEND_KEYBOARD=0: the game view's own keyboard instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时使用游戏视图自带的键盘。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_HWINPUT=0: no keyboard/mouse bridging, no pointer recognisers, no touch filter, no drawn cursor; the app behaves as it did before this file existed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用硬件键盘、鼠标与指针桥接，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_IMAGE_RELOAD (default 1): 1 the same image reloaded at the same base by the same process gets its copy rebuilt in place (same pool address, fresh bytes, relocations and x18 patches redone); any other reuse of an unmapped copy get...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相同进程在相同地址重新加载映像时刷新代码、重定位和修补。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_INPUT_FOCUS=0: keyboard and mouse reach the program whatever has focus (the program still gets nothing while the app is inactive: held input is released then).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅向获得焦点的程序发送键盘与鼠标输入。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_LAZY_PLACEHOLDERS=0 reserves 64 MB to 1 GB placeholders whole again (ml1310)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按需预留占位区域；0 一次预留整个区域。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_LIBRARY_COLLAPSE=0: the section titles do not collapse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许折叠游戏库分组，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_POINTER_ABSOLUTE=0: the program's cursor never follows the iOS pointer's position; all motion is relative.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让程序指针跟随系统指针的绝对位置；0 只使用相对移动。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_POINTER_AUTOLOCK=0: the pointer locks only on request, not while the program hides its cursor (see `AutoLock`).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序隐藏指针时自动锁定鼠标；0 仅手动锁定。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_POINTER_HIDDEN_ABSOLUTE=1 (a game's own config): the program's cursor follows the iOS pointer's position even while it hides the Windows cursor, and the pointer never locks by itself. For a game that hides the cursor only to draw...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使游戏隐藏指针也使用绝对位置，并禁止自动锁定。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_POINTER_LOCK=0: the pointer is never locked and no lock button or chord is offered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用指针锁定及相关按钮与快捷键，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_REGFLUSH_SAVE=0: RegFlushKey does nothing again; the registry is saved periodically and at exit (ml1310)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RegFlushKey 立即保存注册表；0 仅周期性或退出时保存。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_SCREEN_W/H: the virtual monitor's session default size, exported by the app before Wine starts (1024x768 when unset); a program's ChangeDisplaySettings changes the current size from there. MADEIRA_SCREEN_SRC names where the defau...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由应用设置虚拟显示器的默认高度。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_SWAP_PUNCH_DEFER=0 keeps every swap file punch synchronous, under the virtual lock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "异步回收交换文件空洞；0 保持同步回收。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_UNIX_EXIT_ROUTE=0: a fatal unix-side error calls plain (shimmed) exit() again (ml1310)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 Unix 端致命错误路由至所属进程的退出处理。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MADEIRA_VIRTUAL_MODE_SET=0: accept a listed mode without programming it -- the monitor keeps the session default size, as before this change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实际应用程序选择的显示模式；0 仅接受请求而不改变分辨率。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MB left before the app's memory limit below which churny sizes are tiered too (default 768, 0 = never)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接近应用内存上限时将频繁重建内存也转入交换层，阈值单位 MB。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "MB: when the 32-bit band has less free address space than this, idle 32-bit window placeholders are handed back (default 256); 0: never": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 位地址余量低于指定 MB 时释放空闲占位窗口；0 不释放。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Made for this game": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于此游戏"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock could not complete the Steam launch (code %@). Export the log before trying again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira Dock 无法完成 Steam 启动（代码 %@）。请先导出日志，再重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock could not initialize the Steam session (code 30). Export the log to identify the failed check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法初始化 Steam 会话（代码 30）。请导出日志查看失败的检查项。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock could not read the one-use Steam sign-in transfer. Steam has not checked the login yet. Export the log before trying again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取一次性 Steam 登录凭据，Steam 尚未检查登录。请先导出日志，再重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock does not support this Steam client build. Dock only drives client builds it has verified; the log has the client fingerprint and the failed check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira Dock 不支持此 Steam 客户端版本。Dock 仅使用经过验证的客户端；日志中包含客户端指纹和失败的检查项。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock exited before a game window appeared. Export the diagnostic log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏窗口出现前 Madeira Dock 已退出。请导出诊断日志。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock finished normally.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira Dock 已正常结束。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock is not built into this app. Run build/madeira-dock/build.sh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此安装未包含 Madeira Dock，请运行 build/madeira-dock/build.sh 构建。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock needs Valve's client components. Download them in Settings › Steam › Madeira Dock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira Dock 需要 Valve 客户端组件。请在“设置 › Steam › Madeira Dock”中下载。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock received a sign-in transfer for a different launch. Close the session and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira Dock 收到了其他启动会话的登录凭据。请关闭会话后重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock stopped before reporting a result. Export the log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira Dock 在报告结果前停止，请导出日志。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira Dock: the app sets MADEIRA_MADSYNC_SESSION=0 only for a session that runs a game's one-time installers first (Wine's services.exe never answered its RPC clients under madsync on device). Unset, or any other value: unchanged. Read...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按当前 Dock 会话选择 madsync；首次安装会话可使用标准同步。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira cannot unpack this archive yet (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 暂时无法解压此压缩包（%@）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira could not create Dock's private sign-in transfer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法创建 Dock 的私有登录凭据传输。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira could not create the StikDebug request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法创建 StikDebug 请求。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira could not open that folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 无法打开该文件夹。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira could not prepare its Windows environment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法准备 Windows 运行环境。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira could not tell which program starts this game. Open its folder in drive_c\\itch and add the game's .exe with + in the library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法确定此游戏的启动程序。请打开 drive_c\\itch 下的游戏文件夹，再点击游戏库中的 + 添加游戏的 .exe。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira couldn't keep the sign-in in this device's Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将登录凭据保存到此设备的钥匙串。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira couldn't reach Apple (%@). Check the internet connection, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接 Apple（%@）。请检查网络连接后重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira does not know whether %@'s saves on this device are the latest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法确定此设备上的 %@ 存档是否为最新。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira has no pairing file for this device. Set up Built-in StikJIT under JIT setup, then refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有此设备的配对文件。请先在 JIT 设置中配置内置 StikJIT，再续签。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira has no recommended settings for this game yet. Empty this game's config?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 暂无此游戏的推荐设置。要清空此游戏的配置吗？"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira has no recommended settings for this game yet; resetting empties this game's config.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 暂无此游戏的推荐设置；重置将清空此游戏的配置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira keeps a Steam sign-in so it can start your Steam games with your own account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 保存 Steam 登录凭据，以使用你自己的账号启动 Steam 游戏。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira keeps an EA sign-in token in this device's Keychain, for this device only. Signing out removes it; installed games stay, but need the sign-in to start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 将 EA 登录令牌保存在此设备的钥匙串中，仅供本设备使用。退出登录会删除令牌；已安装游戏会保留，但启动时仍需登录。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira kept it running for %@ minutes in the background. Open Madeira to carry on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 已在后台运行游戏 %@ 分钟。打开 Madeira 即可继续。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira ml1310: ask for the media again only when the answer named a new place to look. An unattended install's callback (the default one included) answers \"same place\" forever, and the loop never ended; report a copy error instead. Idea...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在安装回调提供新位置时重新查找介质，避免无限循环。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira recommends its standard settings for the Desktop: ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 建议桌面使用标准设置："
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira runs Windows games on your %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 可在你的 %@ 上运行 Windows 游戏。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira signs in with Steam directly. Your password is sent only to Steam and is never stored. A sign-in token is kept in this device's Keychain until you sign out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 直接登录 Steam。密码仅发送给 Steam，不会保存。登录令牌会保存在此设备的钥匙串中，直到你退出登录。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira starts the game the way the EA app would: it fetches the game's licence for your account, and stands in for the EA app's local service while the game runs. There is no EA app in Madeira, so friends, the overlay and cloud saves are not available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 按照 EA 应用的方式启动游戏：获取你账号的游戏许可证，并在游戏运行时提供 EA 应用的本地服务。Madeira 内不包含 EA 应用，因此好友、游戏内覆盖界面和云存档不可用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira wow64-peb-self: wow_peb is a session global that init_peb() sets for a 32-bit child and loader_ios.c temporarily clears while a 64-bit child runs unix_init_startup_info(). A 32-bit thread querying ProcessWow64Information during t...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 WoW64 调用使用所属进程的进程环境块。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira's recommended settings for %@: %@ config lines%@. Resetting replaces this game's config and these switches with them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 为 %@ 推荐的设置：%@ 行配置%@。重置会用推荐值替换此游戏的配置和开关。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira's sign-in is for another Apple ID than the one this copy was signed with. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前 Apple ID 与为此 Madeira 安装签名的账号不同。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madeira: MADEIRA_PROBES picks which always-on profilers start, for timing runs: unset/1 = all (as before); \"light\" = only the xprobe ([xp]/[xp-t]/[xp-api], counters read 4x a second, no thread is ever suspended); 0 = none. The thread sam...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择性能探测集合，light 仅保留轻量计数器。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Madsync (in-process sync)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madsync 进程内同步"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Manifest data too small": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清单数据过小"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Many Windows games are built with Microsoft Visual C++ and need its 2015-2022 runtime. Madeira downloads Microsoft's own installers and takes the runtime out of them, for 64-bit and 32-bit games alike. Games find it at their next start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "许多 Windows 游戏使用 Microsoft Visual C++ 开发，需要 2015–2022 运行库。Madeira 从微软官方安装包中提取运行库，同时支持 64 位和 32 位游戏，下次启动游戏时即可使用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Many Windows games need Microsoft's Visual C++ 2015-2022 runtime. Madeira downloads Microsoft's installers (about %@ MB, version %@) and takes the runtime DLLs out of them on this device, as Microsoft shipped them, for 64-bit and 32-bit games. No Windows session runs and nothing restarts: the next game start uses them. Microsoft's licence terms for the redistributable apply to the files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "许多 Windows 游戏需要微软的 Visual C++ 2015–2022 运行库。Madeira 下载微软官方安装包（约 %@ MB，版本 %@），在此设备上提取 64 位与 32 位运行库 DLL，并保持原样。无需运行 Windows 会话或重启，下次启动游戏即可使用。这些文件遵循微软再发行组件的许可条款。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Media": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "媒体"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Media: MP4 video (32-bit programs)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 位程序播放 MP4 视频"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Memory & JIT pool": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存与 JIT 池"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Memory and sync": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存与同步"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Memory+ requires the Increased Memory Limit entitlement in this signed copy of Madeira. Enabling JIT does not grant it. Check that your signing tool enables this capability for Madeira, then sign and install the updated app without deleting your existing installation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存增强需要当前 Madeira 签名包含“提高内存上限”权限，启用 JIT 不会授予此权限。请确认签名工具已为 Madeira 启用此能力，再重新签名并覆盖安装，不要删除现有安装。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Menu": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
