    "Minutes a Steam, Epic, GOG, EA or itch.io download keeps going after you switch apps or lock the screen. Then it pauses cleanly and continues when Madeira is active again. 0: only iOS's short grace period, as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换应用或锁屏后继续下载的分钟数。到时安全暂停，返回后继续；0 仅使用 iOS 的短暂后台时间。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Minutes a running game keeps going after you switch apps or lock the screen, so a long load finishes while you are away. Loading and other CPU work go on; drawing waits until Madeira is back (background-pause). The game's sound is muted meanwhile. 0: iOS pauses the game within seconds, as before. A game's own config can set it. [bg-run] lines in the log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换应用或锁屏后继续运行游戏的分钟数。后台继续 CPU 工作，暂停绘制并默认静音；0 表示由 iOS 尽快暂停。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
