          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字键盘 ."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Numpad −": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字键盘 −"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "OUT NON-EXEC off=0xa848000...). The next process started in that session (the windowed taskbar's in-session launcher: services.exe, then steam.exe) got its ntdll copy there and faulted NOEXEC at LdrInitializeThunk's first instruction, fo...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隔离已失去执行权限的 JIT 页面，防止再次分配。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off (default)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭（默认）"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off (spend the pool)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭（用尽共享池）"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off by default: memory of the Chromium browsers next to a game (Social Club's SocialClubHelper.exe, Steam's steamwebhelper.exe) is backed by the swap file, never by the donor pool. The pool is handed out by reserved size whether the pages are used or not, and Social Club's 4 GB allocator reservation used to take all of it before the game asked. 1: browsers take donor RAM like any program. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭，浏览器辅助进程优先使用交换文件。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off by default: no Settings section, no refresh or offer over the library and no sign-in taken from an installer. A refresh asks Apple's portal for a profile on the Apple ID that signs other apps too, so the installer that signed Madeira...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用应用签名续期功能，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off by default: one file per converted shader in Documents/shadercache, as before. 1: the converter keeps its DXBC and DXIL cache entries in two append-only files (shadercache/pack/dxbc.mdpk, dxil.mdpk); loose entries of earlier runs move in as games use them. Off again, the packs are not read: what moved into them converts again. Bounds: DXIL as env.MADEIRA_D3D12_DXIL_CACHE_MB (512 MB), DXBC 2 GB; a full pack starts over. Read once per app start; the game's own file wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 DXBC/DXIL 缓存放入两个追加式文件。关闭后不读取包文件，超出上限时重新建立缓存。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off by default: while a game keeps running in the background its sound is muted, and other apps' audio plays normally. 1: you keep hearing the game. A game's own config can set it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。启用后，游戏在后台继续发声；可由游戏的单独配置覆盖。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_EA = 0`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时关闭 EA 游戏库。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_EPIC = 0`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时关闭 Epic Games 游戏库。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_GOG = 0`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时关闭 GOG 游戏库。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_ITCH = 0`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 0 时关闭 itch.io 游戏库。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_STEAM_LIBRARY = 0`, or without Madeira Dock (a downloaded game starts through it).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用 Steam 游戏库，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off with `env.MADEIRA_STEAM_WORKSHOP = 0`: no Workshop page or area.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示创意工坊页面与区域，0 隐藏。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Off, MoltenVK with d3d12 = vkd3d or d3d11 = dxvk": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭；使用 vkd3d 或 DXVK 时启用 MoltenVK"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Offer ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "商品 ID"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Offline: Steam found this game's license in what it saved. Starting the game…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线模式：Steam 已在本地记录中找到此游戏的许可证，正在启动…"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Offline: Steam signed in from its saved sign-in. Checking this game's license…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线模式：Steam 已使用保存的凭据登录，正在检查游戏许可证…"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启（默认）"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default): DXMT's DXGI presents for a Direct3D 12 device on Vulkan (d3d12 = vkd3d) by wrapping vkd3d-proton's swapchain (IDXGIVkSwapChainFactory); windowed only, a fullscreen request keeps the window. 0: CreateSwapChain fails with \"Unsupported device type\" for those devices, as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由 DXMT 的 DXGI 包装 Vulkan 交换链，目前仅支持窗口模式。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default): XInput rumble plays on the controller (CoreHaptics), and in DualSense HID mode the game's output reports drive rumble, adaptive triggers (closest GameController mode), lightbar and player LEDs. hid: only the DualSense's; xinput: only XInput rumble; 0: none. Read at session start; the game's own file wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用。可选仅 DualSense HID 输出、仅 XInput 震动，或设为 0 全部关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default): XInputGetBatteryInformation reports each pad's GameController battery (wired while charging, else a level) and XInputGetCapabilities flags a battery-powered pad as wireless. 0: an unknown battery, as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，提供真实电量与充电状态；0 报告为未知。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default): a 32-bit program's glGetQueryObject*v result pointer is an offset into the bound GL_QUERY_BUFFER (wined3d reads occlusion results that way; converting it as a pointer left the game spinning at 1 fps, ml1340). 0: the old pointer conversion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正确将查询结果地址解释为绑定缓冲区中的偏移。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default): a session that found no fonts leaves the registry's Fonts key alone, stale external entries that name a font of C:\\windows\\Fonts are dropped, and the Windows directory's fonts get their Fonts values back (DirectWrite lists only those, so without them embedded browsers crash and dialogs draw no text). 0: upstream Wine's font key update. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除失效字体项并使用系统字体目录，默认启用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default): each Windows process gets its own keyed event for the waits and wakes that pass no handle (RtlRunOnce among them), created on first use. 0: every process uses the one the first process created, as before, whose handle is not valid in the others (Slay the Spire 2 failed in RtlRunOnceComplete). Read once per app run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，避免不同进程之间的同步冲突。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default): when a game has switched XInput off (XInputEnable(FALSE), usually on losing focus) but its window is in front, it still reads the pad; activation messages at startup can leave it off for good. 0: the pad reads at rest while disabled, as before. Read by win32u, so 32- and 64-bit games alike.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏在前台时保持 XInput 输入，避免失去焦点后无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On (default): when player 1's controller reconnects and GameController reports it as a new controller before the old one leaves, it is moved from the slot it landed in back to slot 0. 0: it stays where it landed, as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，将重连的玩家 1 手柄放回原槽位。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On another device, open the Steam app, go to Steam Guard, and scan this code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在另一台设备上打开 Steam 应用，进入 Steam 令牌页面并扫描此二维码。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default (500 ms): an identical interface, address or route table read within this many milliseconds reuses the last result. 0 reads the host every time; at most 5000.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存相同网络接口与路由查询，默认 500 毫秒；0 每次读取。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default with skin-check. 0: log only, with no GPU copies, which add a copy between the skinning dispatches and the draw (to compare what the frames look like).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随蒙皮诊断默认开启，0 仅记录而不执行 GPU 复制。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. 0: OPTIONS1 reports WaveOps FALSE, so a game with a fallback picks shaders without wave intrinsics (an A/B for the shader converter's wave code; Horizon Zero Dawn reads it). Read once per game start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用；关闭可测试游戏不使用波内建指令的后备路径。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. A 32-bit Direct3D 9 game writes its index buffers through a copy Madeira keeps; an indexed draw now copies only the indices it reads into the buffer the GPU reads, instead of the whole buffer before every draw after a lock (the slowdown in engines that lock a little of one big index buffer before each draw, such as Call of Duty's). A lock without NOOVERWRITE still gives the next draw a fresh buffer, so draws already recorded keep what they read. [d3d9-index-range] lines in the log say how much was copied. 0: the whole-buffer copy, as before. Read once per session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，避免每次上传整个索引缓冲区。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. A Direct3D 9 program may render into an L8, A8L8 or L16 texture (one-channel targets for ambient occlusion, blur passes or masks), as native drivers and DXVK allow; DXMT used to refuse the texture, and a program that builds such targets through its engine's format table then got none and could sit on its loading screen for good. The storage is R8Unorm, RG8Unorm or R16Unorm, renderable on every Metal GPU; the shader's .r lands in the luminance channel and samples read back as (L, L, L, 1). 0: refuse them, as before. Read once per session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，允许 L8、A8L8、L16 纹理作为渲染目标。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. A whole render-target or depth-stencil clear becomes the clear the next render pass that draws to that target starts with: a clear no longer ends the pass in progress unless it is one of that pass's own targets, and needs no pass of its own (which wrote the whole target to memory and read it back later). A barrier or copy that names the cleared texture, or a pass or clear that uses it through another view, applies the clear first, so nothing sees it uncleared. 0: every clear ends the open pass and goes before the next pass on its own, as before. Read once per game start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，将整张目标的清除合并到下一次渲染开始；资源被其他命令使用前仍会执行清除。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. MADEIRA_ARENA_GUARD=0 lets a fixed or hinted guest reservation take FEX arena space again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保护 FEX 地址区域，避免客户机的固定地址请求占用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. MADEIRA_THREAD_REUSE=0 never gives a full thread registry's exited or purged entries to new threads (a session again registers 512 threads at most).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复用已退出线程的注册表条目；0 禁止复用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. MFC comes from the same Microsoft VC++ package as the C++ runtime and is linked into the game's system32; games that import it (Horizon Zero Dawn) stop at once without it. Wine has no MFC of its own. 0 leaves it out. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认提供 mfc140.dll 与 mfc140u.dll，供依赖 MFC 的游戏加载。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. The Direct3D 12 runtime's shader cache (AppData\\Local\\Madeira\\ShaderCache) is read and written by Madeira itself instead of through Wine's file calls, which asked Wine's server three times per entry (~3.5 ms each in Horizon Zero Dawn's menu, ~1,000 entries a second, with the server on a performance core). The same files either way. 0: Wine's file calls, as before. Read when the game creates its first pipeline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认绕过 Wine 文件调用，由 Madeira 直接读写缓存。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. When a program of the session exits (a launcher restarting itself, RockstarService.exe, a setup step), the emulator's code buffers it held go back to the JIT pool: reusable 3 seconds later, once no thread runs in them. Before, they stayed in use until Madeira closed, and a game started after many such exits got 16 MB code buffers and ran slowly. 0 keeps them in use, as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出后等待安全期，确认没有线程执行，再归还 JIT 池。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default. While Madeira is not the active app, any thread other than the app's main thread that commits a Metal command buffer waits until Madeira is back, so a game that keeps loading in the background (Zink OpenGL, Direct3D, Vulkan) never sends GPU work iOS refuses and never loses its device. [metal-bg] lines in the log. 0: not installed. Read at app start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用。进入后台后暂停非主线程的 Metal 提交，返回前台再恢复，避免 GPU 设备丢失。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: a 64-bit game started beside 32-bit helpers keeps memory it frees and allocates again soon in RAM instead of the swap file, until less than MADEIRA_SWAP_CHURN_TIGHT_MB is left before the memory limit. 0: that memory goes to the donor pool or the swap file like the rest (slower once the device is out of free RAM). Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存余量充足时，64 位游戏反复分配的内存不进入交换文件。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: a game that plays 5.1 or 7.1 sound has every channel folded into the two speakers, so voices (in the centre channel), bass and the rear channels are heard. Off keeps only the front left and right channels, as Madeira did before, which loses most dialogue in a surround game. Applies at the next game start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，合并中置、低音及后置声道，避免对白丢失；下次启动游戏生效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: a guest's anonymous RWX data heap (Mono's Boehm GC) is plain read/write memory. 0 maps it through the JIT pool again, with every store emulated, as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将匿名 RWX 数据堆作为普通读写内存，避免逐次模拟写入。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: an async I/O completion for a busy thread goes to a waiting thread of its process, if there is one, instead of failing the I/O. 0 always drops it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将忙碌线程的异步 I/O 完成事件转给同进程的等待线程。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: an overwrite (supersede, overwrite, overwrite-if) through a link to a read-only file replaces the link with a new file. 0 fails it with access denied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "覆盖只读文件链接时创建新文件替换链接，默认启用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: memory a game frees and allocates again soon takes donor RAM while the pool has room, instead of counting against the app's memory limit. 0: it stays in the app's own memory as before. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，让频繁释放和重建的内存优先使用共享 RAM。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: programs see this device's network interfaces, IP addresses and routes. 0 serves none of them, as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向 Windows 程序报告设备网络接口、IP 与路由，0 返回空表。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: the Settings tab lists its pages, each opening the sections it holds. 0: the one long page with every section, as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认按页面分组显示设置；0 改为单个长页面。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: when a game in a Madeira Dock session asks Steam to start another game (steam.exe with steam://run/<App ID>, as Black Ops II's campaign does for Zombies), steam.exe is not started and Madeira starts that game when it is next opened. 0 lets steam.exe start as before (the full Steam client, which updates itself and stops at a black window in a Dock session).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拦截 Steam 游戏间的启动请求，在重启 Madeira 后启动目标游戏。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: without \\\\.\\Nsi, an address-change request stays pending (the addresses do not change) instead of failing at once. 0 fails it as before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络设备不可用时保留地址变化通知请求，而非立即失败。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default: without \\\\.\\Nsi, the failed open is remembered instead of being retried on every call. 0 retries every time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存不可用的网络状态设备，避免每次重复打开。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On by default; 0 turns it off. SocialClubHelper.exe runs --single-process with PartitionAllocBackupRefPtr disabled and V8 --jitless (MADEIRA_JITLESS = 0 keeps V8's JIT), its --type= children are refused, and a process with socialclub.dll mapped that is not the helper (the game) gets no JIT-pool copy of libcef.dll: its load fails, as it did when the pool was full. No effect on programs without Social Club.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认启用，以解释执行和兼容参数运行浏览器辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On iOS 26 and later, Steam downloads continue in the background as a continued-processing task that iOS shows with its progress. 0: only the short grace period, then a clean pause until Madeira is active again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 26 以上通过系统后台任务继续下载并显示进度；0 使用短暂后台时间。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On while it runs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行期间启用"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "On: x64 games get Mesa's opengl32.dll (OpenGL 3.3 on D3D12, then Metal) when build/mesa-d3d12/build.sh has put it in the app. 0: Wine's builtin opengl32, which uses the native WGL OpenGL ES/Zink route. A game folder's own opengl32.dll still wins. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 x64 游戏提供 OpenGL 3.3；0 使用 Wine 的原生 WGL 路径。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Once Wine points stderr at madeira-log.txt, the app's own log lines are written through stderr too (appendToFile); 0 keeps a per-call file handle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过标准错误流写入应用日志；0 使用每次单独打开文件的方式。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "One Metal call per encoder, not per draw": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合并编码器命令"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "One Wine session per app run (see LibraryModel.sessionsThisRun).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次应用运行仅允许一个 Wine 会话。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "One-shot env-var read. DXMT_DUMP_D9_SHADER=1 enables a per-create summary line via Logger::warn (so it shows up in d3d9.log alongside the first-call traces). Off by default to avoid unconditional spam from apps that create hundreds of sh...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建 Direct3D 9 着色器时输出摘要，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "One-time installs completed successfully. Close Madeira and open it again to play the game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次运行组件已安装成功。请关闭并重新打开 Madeira，再开始游戏。"
