    },
    "Only with env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW set: how much energy the running balance may drift above or below the target before the cap moves one step (100-100000; unset or out of range: 1500). Smaller moves the cap sooner and more often. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行能耗偏离目标多少毫焦耳后调整帧率。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Only with env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW set: the highest frame cap the governor uses, the largest of 60, 40, 30, 24 and 20 at or below this value (20 when lower). Unset: 60. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限制自动功耗调节可用的最高帧率。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Only with env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW set: the lowest frame cap the governor goes down to, the smallest of 60, 40, 30, 24 and 20 at or above this value, never above the highest cap. Unset: 20. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
