    "OpenGL backend for the winios GL driver (build/win32u-unix/opengl_ios.c): zink - desktop OpenGL 3.3-4.x: Mesa OSMesa + Zink on MoltenVK, from the bundle's gl/ folder (build/mesa-ios, build/moltenvk-ios) gles - Apple's OpenGL ES 3.0 (EAGL...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 OpenGL 后端：Zink 提供桌面 OpenGL，GLES 使用系统 OpenGL ES。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "OpenGL through Mesa on D3D12": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 D3D12 运行 Mesa OpenGL"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Opt-in (MADEIRA_DINPUT_TRACE=1) and limited by a PROCESS-wide call counter: the per-device millisecond limiter never engaged for a title that re-creates its device constantly, and 260,000 trace lines in one session cost more than the inp...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录 DirectInput 调用诊断，输出次数受进程级上限限制。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Opt-in (default off). Serves tiny GetRenderTargetData readbacks, such as a 1x1 exposure sample, one frame late instead of waiting on the GPU. Applies to 32-bit D3D9 games that read a small render target back every frame.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小型 Direct3D 9 读回延迟一帧，避免立即等待 GPU，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Opt-in (env.MADEIRA_DEVICE_STATS = 1): a line every 10 s during every session is a diagnostic, so it is off by default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每 10 秒记录设备状态诊断，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Opt-in `env.MADEIRA_THERMAL_CAP = 1`: when iOS reports the device as serious or critical, a session paced at the 60 cap, MAX or RAW drops to the 40 cap (three refreshes at 120 Hz, so evenly spaced; the 30 cap where 40 is not offered). A ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备严重发热时自动降帧，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Opt-in diagnostics: DXMT_CACHE_STATS=1 logs hit/miss counts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录 DXMT 缓存命中与未命中次数。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Opt-in per launch: a 512 MB JIT pool instead of the standard one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次启动使用较小的 512 MB JIT 池。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Opt-out only: this strictly removes a dependency on a port we do not own, so it defaults ON. MADEIRA_TASK_EXC=0 restores the pre-ml522 behaviour for a same-build A/B against the ~54s stall.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用应用自身的异常处理端口，默认启用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Optional MADEIRA_ARGS: Windows command-line quoting (CommandLineToArgvW rules), at most 64 arguments in 4 KB. Malformed or oversized input fails the launch instead of silently dropping or splitting arguments.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动参数遵循 Windows 命令行引号规则，最多 64 个参数、总长 4 KB；格式错误会阻止启动。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Optional bytecode-to-disk dump. Empty -> disabled. Set to a writable directory path; we write one file per unique bytecode hash, so the session ends with a directory containing every shader the app created.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
