            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解码部分游戏数据（%@）。请重试，已下载的内容会保留。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Passed into the game's environment and read by a bundled Java runtime (e.g. -XX:-UseZGC to leave a garbage collector off that cannot map its heap here).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "传入游戏环境，例如选择与设备兼容的垃圾回收器。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Passed into the game's environment and read by the .NET (CoreCLR) runtime itself. 0 turns off its write-xor-execute double mapping of JIT code, for a .NET game whose JIT stops at start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 关闭 CoreCLR 的 JIT 双映射，用于兼容部分 .NET 游戏。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Passed into the game's environment and read by the .NET runtime: the size (hex bytes) of the address range its regions GC reserves at start, for a .NET game whose default reservation fails.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以十六进制字节数指定区域回收器启动时保留的地址范围。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Paste from Clipboard": {
