    "Percent of the game's level, 10-200; unset or 100 leaves it unchanged. Read once, at the first audio endpoint. Set it in the game's own file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏原始音量的百分比，范围 10–200；100 不改变音量。首次打开音频时读取。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Physical controllers (XInput)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实体手柄 XInput"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Pick a folder on a USB or SSD drive, or a whole drive that already has games on it. Windows sees it as a drive letter and as C:\\External\\<name>. Find games adds the games on it to the library; Steam libraries on it (steamapps or SteamLibrary) show up in the Steam section. Install Steam games on picks where new Steam downloads go by default (each install can still pick another place); on a drive they go into <name>\\SteamLibrary. Unplugging the drive while a game runs will close it. Restart Madeira after adding a folder for Windows to list the new drive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 USB 或 SSD 磁盘上的文件夹，也可选择已有游戏的整个磁盘。Windows 会通过盘符和 C:\\External\\<name> 访问它。“查找游戏”会将其中的游戏加入游戏库；Steam 游戏库（steamapps 或 SteamLibrary）会显示在 Steam 区域。“Steam 游戏安装位置”用于设置默认下载位置，每次安装仍可另选；外置磁盘上的下载位于 <name>\\SteamLibrary。运行游戏时拔出磁盘会关闭游戏。添加文件夹后请重启 Madeira，让 Windows 识别新磁盘。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Pick which exe to run (env var override, default = cube.exe). Set MADEIRA_EXE=hello-x64.exe in env to launch the ARM64EC test path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定要运行的 Windows 程序路径或名称。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Pin Metal's own shader and pipeline cache to the per-executable directory the disk shader cache uses (the d3d11 backend does the same at provider init). Without it the OS cache keys off the wine loader's identity and pipeline links never...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让 Metal 系统缓存与每个程序的着色器缓存使用相同目录。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Pipeline archive: compile once": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管线归档仅编译一次"
          }
        }
      },
