    "Re-read a controller's input profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新读取手柄输入配置"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Read by DXMT's d3d11 with the small-rings change. Program file names separated by ';' (e.g. Launcher.exe;SocialClubHelper.exe), or 1 for every program: in those programs DXMT's staging ring, copy-temp ring and upload heap use 4 MB Metal blocks instead of 32 MB. A ring keeps its blocks until 300 later submissions and an idle program keeps them for good (Rockstar Games Launcher 132 MB, Social Club 68 MB through a whole RDR2 session). Larger uploads still get a block of their own; each named program logs one [small-rings] line. Unset or 0 (default): 32 MB, as before. Set it in the game's own file; read when the program starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "程序名用分号分隔，1 表示所有程序。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Read by DXMT's dxgi with the budget-event change. The video memory budget DXGI reports shrinks as Madeira nears its memory limit (vram-trim-mb below it). 1: a game's budget-change event is registered for real, signalled at once and again whenever the budget moves by 32 MB, so a game that waits for it (Red Dead Redemption 2) reads the smaller budget and frees textures. Off (default): the registration is refused, as before. Set it in the game's own file; read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许游戏注册显存预算事件，在接近应用内存上限时回收资源。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Read on every call: the app sets it per session (a game's \"Pause threads fully\" switch, BCDLaunch.realSuspend), and this server runs again in the same process for the next session of the app run. Logged when it changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整暂停线程，由游戏单独设置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Read once. The switch exists so a device regression can be separated from this path without a rebuild.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制 D3D12 根签名反序列化路径，每次启动读取一次。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Read the two knobs once, from _d3d9_init, on the guest's own thread.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "统计原生 Direct3D 9 前端调用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Real opengl32 unix side (OpenGL ES / desktop GL through the winios WGL driver). MADEIRA_NO_GL=1 keeps the old GL-absent stub table. The wow64 table's thunks convert every embedded guest pointer with ios_wow_host_ptr() (patches/wine-openg...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设为 1 时禁用 OpenGL 的 Unix 实现。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Received an invalid message from Steam.": {
