          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Sign in with the Apple ID this copy of Madeira was installed with. Madeira signs in to Apple itself: your password does not leave this device and is not kept. What is kept, in this device's Keychain, is a token for Apple's developer service. An anisette server (%@ first) supplies the device data Apple asks for, and sees neither your Apple ID nor your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请使用安装此 Madeira 时的 Apple ID 登录。Madeira 直接向 Apple 登录：密码不会离开此设备，也不会保存。此设备的钥匙串仅保存 Apple 开发者服务令牌。anisette 服务器（优先使用 %@）提供 Apple 要求的设备数据，无法获取你的 Apple ID 或密码。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
