    },
    "Small MANAGED mirrors are inexpensive, but reconstructing even a tiny one drains the GPU queue. Keep a bounded working set without changing LockRect visibility or discarding the CPU's authoritative bytes. Shared across devices in this mo...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存小型托管纹理镜像，避免反复重建和排空 GPU 队列。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Small images in spare code-buffer space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小型映像使用闲置代码空间"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "So, on a small address map only (ios_wow_small_va_slots != 0, which is 0 on a 512 GB map) and only after the MAP_FIXED itself failed with ENOMEM, the next free range of the same area is tried, at most IOS_RESERVED_RETRY_MAX times, each o...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小地址空间内固定映射失败时尝试相同区域中的其他空位。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
