    },
    "Steam signed in offline, but what it has saved does not list this game. Start this game once while online, then it can be played offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 已离线登录，但保存的许可证列表中没有此游戏。联网启动此游戏一次后即可离线游玩。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Steam signed in online on this device on %@ and can now sign this account in without a connection. With no internet, Madeira asks Steam to start the game offline; Steam checks its saved sign-in and its saved list of your licenses each time. Its offline sign-in expires after a while, so start a game online now and then. A game that needs its own servers still needs them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 已于 %@ 在此设备上联网登录，此账号现在可离线登录。没有网络时，Madeira 会请求 Steam 离线启动游戏，Steam 每次都会检查保存的凭据和许可证。离线登录凭据会过期，请偶尔联网启动一次游戏。需要连接自身服务器的游戏仍需联网。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Steam started this game's program, but Madeira could not load it (Steam reports an invalid platform). Export the log: it names the reason.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 已启动游戏程序，但 Madeira 无法加载，Steam 报告平台无效。请导出日志查看原因。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Steam still says this account is playing in another session. Close the game on your other device (or wait a few minutes after a closed session) and start it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 仍显示此账号正在其他会话中游戏。请关闭另一台设备上的游戏，或等待已关闭的会话结束后再启动。"
          }
        }
