    "Steam's download servers would not hand out this game's file list (HTTP %@), even after Madeira asked Steam for new download permission. Wait a few minutes and tap Try again; downloaded parts are kept. If it keeps happening, check that the game still shows in your Steam library and send Madeira's log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 下载服务器拒绝提供游戏文件列表（HTTP %@），重新请求下载权限后仍未成功。请稍等几分钟再点击“重试”，已下载的内容会保留。如果持续失败，请确认游戏仍在 Steam 游戏库中，并提供 Madeira 日志。"
