    "Sync runs when Madeira starts and when this page opens. Replaced files are kept in Files › Madeira › Epic Cloud Backups. Sync now uploads newer device saves%@. If both sides changed, choose which saves to keep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira 启动或打开此页面时会同步存档。替换的文件保存在“文件 › Madeira › Epic Cloud Backups”。“立即同步”会上传设备上较新的存档%@。如果两端都有改动，请选择要保留的存档。"
