          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试扩展内存"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Testing extension memory…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在测试扩展内存…"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Testing...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在测试…"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Text me a new code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新发送短信验证码"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Texting a code to %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在向 %@ 发送短信验证码…"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "That Steam Guard code is not correct. Try again with a new code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam Guard 验证码不正确，请使用新验证码重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "That folder is already registered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件夹已添加。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "That is not the Apple ID this copy of Madeira was signed with (team %@). ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Apple ID 与签名此 Madeira 安装时使用的账号不一致（团队 %@）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "That zip holds no saves (nothing under users/).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 ZIP 中没有存档（users/ 下没有内容）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The %@ download finished.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 下载完成。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The %@ shortcut did not run: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 快捷指令未能运行：%@。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The %@ version needs a beta code Steam accepts. Enter it under Game details › Steam › Version, or pick another version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 版本需要有效的测试代码。请在“游戏详情 › Steam › 版本”中输入，或选择其他版本。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The Display and Memory and sync settings, on the long page and as pages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示分辨率、内存与同步设置页面。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The Dock session did not start. See the log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dock 会话未能启动，请查看日志。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The PC answered %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑返回 %@。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The PC closed the connection (errno %@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑已关闭连接（errno %@）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The PC on this network is no longer used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止使用此局域网电脑。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The PC stopped answering.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑已停止响应。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The PC stopped mid-answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑在响应过程中停止。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The QoS class guest threads run at while eco is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择节能模式下客户机线程的调度等级。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The Visual C++ 2015-2022 runtime is installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 Visual C++ 2015–2022 运行库。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The Vulkan driver Wine's winevulkan loads: moltenvk = gl/libMoltenVK.dylib (the one Zink uses), kosmickrisp = gl/libvulkan_kosmickrisp.dylib, or a .dylib path (absolute or bundle-relative). Setting it turns Vulkan on for x64 programs (vulkan-1.dll and winevulkan.dll in the prefix); unset, Vulkan is off unless d3d12 = vkd3d or d3d11 = dxvk. Read at session start; also from a game's own lines.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 MoltenVK、KosmicKrisp 或指定动态库路径。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The Vulkan driver Zink runs desktop OpenGL (and d3d9 = wined3d) on: MoltenVK (default) or KosmicKrisp (gl/libvulkan_kosmickrisp.dylib); any other value is a .dylib name in the gl folder or an absolute path. env.MADEIRA_GL_VULKAN is the fallback. Read when a program first creates an OpenGL context; the log says \"ml1344 zink Vulkan library: ...\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zink 默认使用 MoltenVK，也可选 KosmicKrisp 或指定动态库。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The Wine prefix has no user folder yet. Start a game once, then sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine 环境中尚无用户文件夹。请先运行一次游戏，再同步存档。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The [vkmt] entry-point trace; MADEIRA_KMT_TRACE=0 turns it off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录 D3DKMT 入口调用，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The account name or password is incorrect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号名称或密码不正确。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The account or game session changed. Try sync again when no game is running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号或游戏会话已改变。请在没有游戏运行时重新同步。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The adapter name Windows reports with MADEIRA_GPU_VENDOR and MADEIRA_GPU_DEVICE; unset, the name of the PCI id. Per game: Game details > Graphics card the game sees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置 Windows 对外报告的适配器名称。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The address range at 0x140000000 kept for a game exe without relocations, which can only run there. Unset: 128 MB, or for a Madeira Dock launch the size of the largest such exe in the game's folder (The Adventures of Elliot: 473 MB -> 480). The JIT pool then starts above it and is that much smaller, so a large one also needs env.MADEIRA_X64_IMAGE_NOCOPY = 1 and pool-split = 1. A number sets it (129 to 960); 128 or less keeps 128 MB. Read at launch, the game's own file wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为无重定位游戏保留固定基址空间，单位 MB。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The archive ended in the middle of a file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压缩包在文件内容中间结束。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The archive has a damaged header.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压缩包头部已损坏。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The archive has a file Madeira will not unpack (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压缩包包含无法安全解压的文件（%@）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The cloud save download is too large.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云存档下载过大。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The cloud save has an invalid file path; nothing was changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云存档包含无效路径，未进行任何修改。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The cloud save is too large to sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云存档过大，无法同步。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The cloud save names a file outside the save folder; nothing was changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云存档引用了存档文件夹之外的文件，未进行任何修改。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The compiler emits bindings only for sampled stages. Avoid sampler-cache probes, Metal texture-view creation and resource retention for stale bindings outside that mask. Fixed-function combiners retain their path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "排除未被着色器使用的旧绑定，减少资源与采样器开销。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The compiler's binding pre-scan and this metadata mask use the same dxso_opcode_samples/dxso_sampling_slot helpers (including SM1 implicit stages). Unread slots never enter its signature or lowering. Keeping their live texture kinds in t...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编译器仅保留着色器实际读取的采样绑定。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The copy is incomplete (%@ of %@ files).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制不完整（%@ / %@ 个文件）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The copy of %@ does not match.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的副本与原文件不一致。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The data abort's ESR says whether the access wrote (WnR, bit 6). The encoding guess below calls the LSE atomics (LDADD, SWP, CAS...: an x86 lock xadd / xchg) reads, because they have bit 22 set, so a write was reported to the guest as a ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从处理器异常状态识别内存写入，避免将原子写操作误判为读取。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The developer interface's Wine desktop size (ml1127); its Resolution menu writes it (ml1157). Madeira Dock sessions without a game's Resolution use it too. Unset: this screen's shape at 1280x720's pixel count (ml1172: 1408x648 on a 19.5:9 iPhone, 1152x800 on an 11-inch iPad). Applies at the next app start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置 Wine 桌面的宽×高。未指定时按屏幕比例选择接近 1280×720 的像素数，下次启动生效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The download does not match Wine Gecko %@ (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载内容与 Wine Gecko %@ 不匹配（%@）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The download does not match the pinned Wine Mono %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载内容与指定版本的 Wine Mono %@ 不匹配。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The download ended early.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载提前结束。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The download is not a readable xz archive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载内容不是可读取的 xz 压缩包。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The downloaded archive is damaged (%@). Download it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的压缩包已损坏（%@），请重新下载。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The executable path or launch arguments are too long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可执行文件路径或启动参数过长。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The external drive is not available. Reconnect it and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外置磁盘不可用，请重新连接后重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The external drive mapping is already in use. Existing files were kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此外置磁盘映射已被占用，已有文件已保留。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The file changed while it was open here, so nothing was saved. Go back and open it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件在打开期间发生了变化，因此未保存任何内容。请返回后重新打开。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game asked to start %@. Madeira runs one game per app session: close Madeira and open it again, and %@ starts by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏请求启动 %@。Madeira 每次会话只能运行一个游戏：请关闭并重新打开 Madeira，%@ 将自动启动。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game changed this file after it was last saved here. Check your changes are still set.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏在上次保存后修改了此文件，请确认你的设置仍然有效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game is starting. Waiting for its window…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏正在启动，等待游戏窗口出现…"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game stopped with Windows error 0x%@%@. Export the diagnostic log to report it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已停止，Windows 错误为 0x%@%@。请导出诊断日志以报告问题。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game's file list from Epic failed its checksum. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Epic 游戏文件列表校验失败，请重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game's files downloaded, but they do not say which program starts the game (__Installer/installerdata.xml). Add the game with + and choose its .exe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏文件已下载，但 __Installer/installerdata.xml 未指定启动程序。请点击 + 添加游戏并选择其 .exe。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game's files downloaded, but they do not say which program starts the game (goggame-<id>.info). Add the game with + and choose its .exe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏文件已下载，但 goggame-<id>.info 未指定启动程序。请点击 + 添加游戏并选择其 .exe。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game's files were not found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未找到游戏文件。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The game's launch arguments are invalid or too long. Edit them in Game details and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏启动参数无效或过长，请在游戏详情中修改后重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The host surface can measure its size in other units than the client rect (an iOS CAMetalLayer reports points), so the host may call a swapchain suboptimal although it matches the window's client rect. The application cannot fix that: a ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "处理宿主表面与 Windows 客户区单位不同导致的次优交换链状态。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The in-game Aspect & scaling choice sticks to the game. MADEIRA_SESSION_TOOLS=0 hides that picker and leaves the stored choice alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示游戏内宽高比和缩放选项；0 隐藏选项但保留已存设置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The in-game menu's Diagnostics (frame capture, GPU sync), for testing: off unless madeira.cfg sets env.MADEIRA_SESSION_DIAGNOSTICS = 1. A capture writes render-target pixels to Documents/capture, which Files shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示游戏菜单中的帧捕获与 GPU 同步诊断工具，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The install could not be removed: ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除安装："
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The install library is invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装库无效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The install record lists per-user executables: Dock asks Valve's client to prepare them before it launches. env.MADEIRA_DOCK_CEG = 0 never asks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求 Steam 准备与账号绑定的游戏可执行文件；0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The install scripts' programs of a game: its own folder (one level down) and the shared redistributables Steam keeps next to it, and how many scripts were read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
