            "value": "控制游戏首次安装脚本的默认注册键。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The largest new reservation the swap tier backs whole: 256 MB in wide (at most 4 GB), 8 GB in broad (at most 16 GB). 9216 with broad coverage (swap-mode = 2) also backs Red Dead Redemption 2's 8960 MB heap with the file. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定交换层可完整支持的最大新区域，单位 MB。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The launch state changed. Enable JIT and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动状态已改变。请启用 JIT 后重试。"
