      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The library file could not be read. Preserve or repair it before making changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取游戏库文件。请先保留或修复此文件，再进行修改。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The library's ambient light: a glow behind every grid card that has reported its frame (only the cards the lazy grids have built). MADEIRA_LIBRARY_AMBIENT=0 turns it off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示游戏卡片背后的环境光；0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The library's store tabs: with Group by Platform, a segmented control at the top of the page shows one store's section at a time (Steam, the games you added, GOG, itch.io, Epic Games, EA app) or All of them. Only the sections the page wo...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按平台分组时显示商店分页，可切换单个平台或全部游戏。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The limit is MEASURED, not assumed: os_proc_available_memory() is what remains before jetsam, and TASK_VM_INFO.phys_footprint is what is already charged, so their sum is this process's effective total. Cached on first use so the advertis...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向程序报告的物理内存总量，单位 MB。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The native frontend (DXMT_MADEIRA) has no user32 boundary and always uses the internal singleton.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制显示器身份映射。"
