      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The same frozen page makes every \"N ms have passed since X\" test in a guest false for the life of the process: a headless host that sits online and re-checks a condition \"5 s after sign-in\" never reaches its check, and its own 90 s wall-...": {
      "localizations": {
