    },
    "The shared-mode engine period, in 100 ns units. A client that keeps one period queued (IAudioClient3) must cover a whole RemoteIO slice, or every render callback empties its queue and plays silence for the rest: at least two slices of th...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
