          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The sign-in request expired. Start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录请求已过期，请重新开始。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The smallest allocation the swap tier backs (ml1257): 8 MB in classic, 1 MB in blocks and wide, 4 MB in broad unless set. MADEIRA_SWAP_MIN_KB overrides it for blocks, wide and broad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按覆盖模式设置最小 MB 阈值，可被 KB 阈值覆盖。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The video memory budget a game reads shrinks as memory runs short (vram-trim-mb), judged by the app's own memory. 1: the donor pool's memory counts as well, since it is the device's RAM even though it is not under the app's limit, so with a full pool on a phone with less RAM the game is told to keep fewer textures. Off by default (a test option). Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，共享内存池也计入设备 RAM 压力判断。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The working folder must be an existing folder on drive C:, such as C:\\Games\\Some Game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
