    "Triage: dump unique layouts under DXMT_DUMP_D9_LAYOUT=1 so we can see what D3DDECLTYPE -> MTLAttributeFormat the host is feeding the manual-fetch path. Useful when a class of draws renders wrong and the suspect is a format mismatch insid...": {
