    "Unset (default): no cap beyond the FPS limit. 10-120: frames start at most N times a second for the whole session: a Direct3D 12 game's thread waits after each Present, a DXMT game's encode thread before each present (a timed kernel wait, not a spin). Any value, e.g. 20 or 24, unlike the FPS limit's 30/40/60; the lower of the two applies. While it is set, env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MW is ignored. Needs the [xp] sampler (MADEIRA_PROBES not 0). Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置 10–120 帧的会话上限，未指定时使用通常的 FPS 限制。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Unset (default): off. N: while the game presents, the process's CPU power ([xp]'s energy) is held at N mW on average by moving a frame cap between 60, 40, 30, 24 and 20 fps (at most one step per 3 s; held while nothing presents). Unlike env.MADEIRA_POWER_GOV_MW it moves no thread to the efficiency cores. Menus and loading at 3-4 W fill the budget after which iOS clamps the CPU; e.g. 1500 keeps a 60 fps menu near 30-40 fps. [fps-gov] lines every 10 s. env.MADEIRA_FPS_GOV_MIN / _MAX (20 / 60) bound the cap, _BAND_MJ (1500) is the energy the average may drift before it moves. Needs the [xp] sampler. Read at session start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定目标毫瓦数，在预设帧率档位间调整；0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Unset or \"emulated\": DXMT's D3D9 frontend, translated by FEX in 32-bit programs (x64 programs always get DXMT's native ARM64EC build). \"native\": 32-bit programs run DXMT's frontend as native ARM64 code. \"wined3d\": 32- and 64-bit programs get Wine's own d3d9 on wined3d's OpenGL renderer (opengl32 on Zink/MoltenVK; needs gl-backend = zink, the default when the bundle has gl/).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认使用 DXMT；32 位程序可选原生 ARM64 前端，或选择 wined3d，通过 Zink/OpenGL 渲染。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Unset: DXMT, Direct3D 10/11 on Metal. \"dxvk\": this session's d3d11.dll, d3d10core.dll and dxgi.dll are DXVK's (Direct3D 10/11 and DXGI on Vulkan, the bundle's vulkan/ folder), replacing DXMT for Direct3D 10/11 and DXGI; Vulkan is on (see vulkan). DXVK's DXGI only presents for Vulkan devices, so Direct3D 12 pairs with vkd3d-proton: with d3d12 unset this implies d3d12 = vkd3d. x64 programs only; read at session start; also from a game's own lines. Experimental, not device-tested.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认使用 DXMT/Metal；dxvk 使用 Vulkan 上的 DXVK。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Unset: a 32-bit window's anonymous RWX memory is plain read/write to the host once Wine Mono's libmono-2.0-x86.dll is mapped there (ml1279/ml1282). 1: in every 32-bit window. 0: never (stores go through the JIT pool's alias, and FEX's Mono bridge stays off).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 32 位匿名 RWX 数据作为普通读写内存处理。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Unset: madeira-d3d12, Direct3D 12 on Metal. \"vkd3d\": this session's d3d12.dll and d3d12core.dll are vkd3d-proton's (Direct3D 12 on Vulkan, the bundle's vulkan/ folder) and Vulkan is on (see vulkan). x64 programs only; read at session start; also from a game's own lines. Not device-tested. \"1\" (ml1095, developer) runs madeira-d3d12's shader converter canary at app start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认使用 madeira-d3d12/Metal；vkd3d 使用 Vulkan 上的 vkd3d-proton。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
