    "WHAT STAYS LOW regardless (unchanged by this policy, and deliberately so): the first TEB block and the PEB32/TEB32 derived from it (virtual_alloc_teb and the first-block allocation both hardcode limit_2g - 1), the KUSER_SHARED_DATA emula...": {
