    "What it changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将修改的内容"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Whether Steam Cloud saves sync: Settings › Steam Cloud saves, kept in madeira.cfg as env.MADEIRA_STEAM_CLOUD (on unless it is 0; docs/STEAM_CLOUD.md). Turning it back on syncs the installed games at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用 Steam 云存档同步，0 关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Whether the app's liquid metal is on: Settings › Appearance › Liquid metal, kept in madeira.cfg as env.MADEIRA_LIQUID_METAL (off, plain Liquid Glass, unless it is 1). It covers the Desktop button's fill (LiquidMetalFill) and the bars' gl...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用液态金属外观，默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Which allocations the swap tier backs with its file (only when the tier is on). Large allocations (classic, the default): single 8 MB+ commits in the guest band. All allocations of 1 MB+ (blocks). 1 MB+ and overflow (wide): blocks plus allocations outside the band and fresh reservations. Whole reservations 4 MB+ (broad, ml1257): every new reservation of at least swap-min-mb (4 MB) below FEX's band backed whole when made, holes punched on decommit, swap-mb caps the disk it uses (a soft cap, checked when a block is backed). Unset: broad if swap-mode = 2, else classic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择大块分配、1 MB 以上分块、溢出区域或更广泛的整段预留。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Which build is installed, shown in light grey in the developer interface, and logged once at start ([build]). A build that writes `MadeiraBuild` into Info.plist (a round tag and build time) shows that; other builds show the bundle versio...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在开发者界面显示构建标识，并在启动时记录到日志。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Which interface Madeira starts with: the library (the default) or the developer interface. The choice is made in either interface, stored in UserDefaults and read once per run, so a change applies at the next start. Without a stored choi...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择游戏库或开发者界面，修改后下次启动生效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Which rule chose the directory, for logging: \"env\", \"container\", \"home\" or \"none\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定应用文稿目录，避免与 Wine 用户目录混淆。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "While Madeira keeps a game or a download running in the background, its CPU use is held under this percent of one core on average (threads are paused for 100 ms at a time when it is over), because iOS ends a background app that averages more than about 80% for a minute. Higher loads faster but risks that. 0: no cap. A game's own config can set it. [bg-cpu] lines in the log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台运行时限制单核平均 CPU 使用率，避免 iOS 终止应用；0 表示不限制。游戏单独配置可覆盖此值。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "While the loader loads Valve's client and its many imports, the emulator's image-map handler can commit a page of its own heap under its interval lock; the commit's notification then waits for that same lock and the host parks for good (...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "避免加载 Steam 模块期间内存提交与映像锁互相等待。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Why a session ended by itself (not Quit): the program the app launched exited with a Windows error (wine_crash_exit_status, WineProcessBridge.m). MADEIRA_EXIT_REPORT=0 returns to the library without a message.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏因 Windows 错误退出时显示原因；0 表示直接返回游戏库。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Windows folder whose 32-bit programs alone may adopt the MADEIRA_WOW_HOLD_WINDOWS placeholders (the app sets the Dock game's folder); unset: any 32-bit program may": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限制哪些文件夹中的 32 位程序可接管保留窗口。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Windows' display adapter: PCI device id (hex)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显卡 PCI 设备 ID"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Windows' display adapter: PCI vendor id (hex)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显卡 PCI 厂商 ID"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Windows' display adapter: name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显卡名称"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Windows, display & input": {
      "localizations": {
