          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口、显示与输入"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine Gecko %@ is ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine Gecko %@ 已就绪"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine Mono %@ is installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装 Wine Mono %@"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine Mono needs about 450 MB of free space while it installs (about 130 MB once installed).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine Mono 安装期间需要约 450 MB 可用空间，安装完成后占用约 130 MB。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine Mono, 32- and 64-bit: mscoree sets MONO_THREADS_SUSPEND=coop and adds keep-delegates to MONO_DEBUG before Mono loads, and puts the previous values back once Mono has read them (ml1282); values already set win. 0 sets nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 Wine Mono 设置兼容的线程暂停与委托保留策略。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine core (ntdll)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine 核心（ntdll）"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine libraries": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine 库"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine reserves a band; the emulator still runs its own selector and picks a different one. Holding 8GB therefore pushes it into whatever is left, and when that band is exhausted its 16MB requests fail, a thread-creation path dereferences ...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 FEX 预留地址区域，避免与其他分配冲突。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine 服务端"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine starts as soon as the wineserver has finished starting up (its registry is loaded), normally within tens of milliseconds, instead of after a fixed 2 s pause. 0 restores the fixed pause.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine 服务端准备好后立即启动游戏；0 恢复固定等待 2 秒。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine trace channels. * 2026-05-19 perf pivot: the verbose default (err+all, fixme+all, warn+module, warn+file, trace+process, trace+module, trace+loaddll, trace+loadorder, trace+win, trace+user32, trace+syscall, trace+file) was generatin...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用详细 Wine 日志；大量跟踪输出可能显著影响性能。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine's locale for this game": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏的 Wine 区域设置"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine's own .NET is used": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Wine 自带的 .NET"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Wine's own UI never noticed, because dialogs read the VK out of wParam. A GAME does notice: Unity reads the keyboard through raw input and DirectInput identifies keys by scan code (DIK_W is 0x11, not 'W'), so W/A/S/D were delivered, acce...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用正确的扫描码报告导航键和原始键盘输入。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "WineHQ answered %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WineHQ 返回 %@。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With %@ (a token for Apple's developer service, not your password, kept in this device's Keychain), Madeira renews its own signing when it is open and LocalDevVPN is connected. It asks Apple and an anisette server, %@ first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 %@（保存在此设备钥匙串中的 Apple 开发者服务令牌，而非密码），Madeira 在前台且 LocalDevVPN 已连接时可以自行续签。它会向 Apple 和 anisette 服务器发送请求，优先使用 %@。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With MADEIRA_GPU_DEVICE: the display adapter win32u registers (EnumDisplayDevices, SetupAPI, the display driver key, D3DKMT), instead of Apple 106B:0001 or the RTX 3060 of Report an NVIDIA GPU. Per game: Game details > Graphics card the game sees, which sets DXGI and Direct3D 9 to the same card.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置游戏看到的显示适配器厂商，使用十六进制。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With MADEIRA_GPU_VENDOR: the adapter's device id. Per game: Game details > Graphics card the game sees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与厂商 ID 配合设置游戏看到的显示适配器。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With no debugger attached, a JIT request fails the launch with a message; 0 lets it crash the app as before. CS_DEBUGGED stays set after a debugger detaches (JIT enabled by a tool that attaches and leaves, or without Madeira's script), a...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未连接调试器时报告 JIT 启动失败，避免应用直接崩溃。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With pool-low on: how much of the free run below the executable window stays free for programs that load there (child processes' main executables). A run with a free run at least this large below it keeps none. 128 by default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在可执行窗口下方保留给其他程序加载的 MB 数。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With pool-split on: fit regions A/B to 16 KB pages instead of 16 MB steps, retaining small remainders in free runs without increasing the requested pool budget. With pool-low on, also fit region C to pages while preserving pool-low-margin. Costs the additional pages in memory. Off by default; read at launch, the game's own file wins. Restart Madeira and enable JIT again after changing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 16 KB 页面而非 16 MB 步长分配，保留小型空余区域。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With pool-split on: the pool takes two runs above the 0x140000000 executable window when together they are larger than the single run it would get -- whether that run lies below the window, where the pool cannot split (GTA V: 368 + 320 MB instead of 464 MB), or is the higher of two runs above it (The Adventures of Elliot: 240 + 288 MB instead of 288 MB). Falls back to the single run if the placement misses. On by default; 0 turns it off. Read at launch, the game's own file wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合计空间更大时以两个区域组成 JIT 池。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With pool-split on: when another mapping sits between the pool's two regions and leaves a free run of 64 MB or more there, that run becomes a third debugger region in the same pool (RDR2 build 470: 604 MB pool, a 71 MB mapping and 213 MB free between the regions; the DLL copies ran out and the game failed with ERR_GFX_INIT). Only from what the two regions left of the pool size; costs that region's size in memory. Off by default (RDR2's list turns it on); read at launch, the game's own file wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中间至少有 64 MB 连续空间时将其加入代码池。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With pso-archive on: 1 (default) compiles a pipeline the saved archive does not have once, into an open archive, and creates it from there. 0: created, then compiled again on one queue to be added (the first version; it kept about a quarter of a session's pipelines).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "归档缺失的管线直接编译并加入归档，避免再次编译。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With pso-archive on: the most a game's pipeline archive folder keeps across builds. Over it, the oldest chunks are deleted at launch down to three quarters; a session adds none once it is reached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过上限时在启动阶段清理最旧的归档，单位 MB。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With skin-check on: a window starts this many presents after the previous one began (at least 30); the first starts 60 presents after the first such draw.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定相邻诊断窗口之间的呈现帧数，至少 30。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "With the GLES backend there is no desktop GL context, so make LOVE ask for OpenGL ES first. LOVE 11 checks this SDL hint (read from the environment) before trying desktop GL; SDL then creates the context through WGL_EXT_create_context_es...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 OpenGL 后端，并告知 SDL/LOVE 使用兼容的图形接口。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Worker threads of the exited process can stay asleep long after its main thread is gone; their TEBs are inside the window. Keep it (the next process takes another slot) while any of them still exists. MADEIRA_WOW_LIVE_WINDOW_GUARD=0 disa...": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出进程仍有存活线程时保留其窗口。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Working…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在处理…"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "WriteBufferImmediate writes its values": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实际执行 WriteBufferImmediate"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Written only by the encode thread (Resolve allocates, commit seals); opt into the DXMT_DEBUG single-writer assertion. single_writer= true": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限制 Direct3D 9 各向异性过滤级别。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "X-desktop probe: shared user32 .data means the 2nd GUI pseudo-process can resolve a NULL winproc (crash: blr NULL in call_window_proc). Log func + resolved procW for the first few calls per process.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录多进程桌面窗口过程解析诊断。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "XInput (default)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "XInput（默认）"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "XInput (default): every controller is an Xbox pad. hid: player 1 becomes a HID game controller, a DualSense (054C:0CE6) when it is a PlayStation pad, and leaves XInput; any other pad stays on XInput. dualsense/generic force the identity. Read at session start; the game's own file wins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认 XInput；HID 模式提供 DualSense 或通用 HID 身份。启动会话时读取，游戏单独配置优先。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "XInput rumble only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅 XInput 震动"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Your Steam sign-in cannot be handed to Dock. Sign in to Steam again in Madeira.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
