    "ml1124: the lock is held for well under a microsecond; a contended pthread_mutex_lock sleeps in the kernel (__psynch_mutexwait, ~20 us measured on average in ph-rdr74, 3.4 k times a second). Spin on trylock first. madeira.cfg madsync-loc...": {
