    "ml1142: madeira.cfg encoder-labels = 1 names every Metal encoder after the pass that opened it (\"R#<seq> <vs>|<ps>\", \"C#<seq> <kernel>\", \"B#<seq> copy\"), so Instruments' Metal System Trace attributes GPU time per pass. Off by default: on...": {
