          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "ml1152: how the extension creates each donated region. ledger (the default): a named memory entry tagged to the extension's ledger. purgeable: a purgeable allocation in the extension named by a memory entry (the way MeloNX donates RAM). Everything else in the tier is the same, so the two can be compared.": {
      "localizations": {
