    "ml2021 A/B: 1 leaves the game's Metal layer in CoreAnimation's display-sync scheduling. Off (the default) sets the private displaySyncEnabled=false (the MeloNX pattern, 2026-07-03). For a title parked 18-72 ms a frame in nextDrawable with the display link honoured at 120 Hz, this is one of the two suspects for late drawables (the other: env.MADEIRA_PROMOTE_KICK).": {
