    "ml2021 experiment: 1 adds a one-pixel layer whose opacity alternates on every display-link tick, so each tick commits a CoreAnimation transaction. For a title parked 80 ms a frame in nextDrawable with the 120 Hz link armed: if the waits fall with this on, the compositor needed a transaction, not an intent.": {
      "localizations": {
