    "ml2021: 1 maps every donated region into the address space when it is registered, as the first port did. Off (the default) maps only the range being freed, for its zeroing: the permanent windows were placed before Wine held the 32-bit guest-window slot and took it, so 32-bit programs failed at guest-window-reserve.": {
