    "ml2021: off (the default) sends a 64-bit program's short-lived allocation sizes to the swap file too while a 32-bit program is in the session, instead of leaving them anonymous (the ml1258 churn filter): beside a 32-bit title the launcher chain is idle, and its anonymous pages were compressed into the footprint. 1 keeps the filter for them.": {
      "localizations": {
