        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "ml2021: what iOS's memory-pressure notification does to the pool. Unset: nothing, the pool is spent like MeloNX's (on an 8 GB phone the critical notification refused 502 takes and left 2.6 GB of the pool unused while the title's own memory, compressed, filled the app's limit; donated pages are the extension's to compress, not the app's). 1: a critical notification stops takes. 2: warning and critical (the old behaviour).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制收到 iOS 内存压力通知时是否停止使用共享内存池。"
