    "ml2210: 1 (the Steam Big Picture list) lets steamwebhelper.exe start exactly one kind of child, --type=crashpad-handler, with its command line unchanged; without it the 32-bit web helper ends itself at start (crash server failed to launch). Every other --type= child stays refused. Off (default): all are refused.": {
