    "ml2250: a 32-bit thread that has waited this many seconds without a timeout for an SRW lock held by shared owners has every 32-bit thread of its process logged once ([srw-hang]: x86 registers, EBP chain, module-resolved stack words), so the holders are named. Logs 116-119: Steam's 32-bit web helper stopped at start that way. 0: off.": {
