    "ml2250: unset (default): never. N: once a 32-bit thread has waited N seconds for an SRW lock as above, the wineserver ends its process, as TerminateProcess from another process would, so a parent that restarts its helper gets a new one (Steam restarts its web helper). At most 3 per app run. The Steam Big Picture list sets 40.": {
