    "ml2260: on (default): when FEX starts in a 64-bit process it records the code sections of every image already loaded (kernel32, kernelbase, ucrtbase are mapped for it before its notifications work). Before, their x64 export thunks were not known as code: a 64-bit x64 program's call into one ended it with c0000005 (log 120: the DirectX redistributable's x64 helper, at its first kernel32 call). 0: as before.": {
