    "ml2270: on (default): when a 64-bit program opens the service manager and services.exe is not running (the session did not start Windows services first), sechost starts it once per process, waits up to 20 s for its pipe and asks again. Before, the call failed: a game from another store whose first start runs a launcher installer could not register the launcher's service and the installer stopped (testers' logs, 2026-10-28: a publisher's launcher installer run by an Epic copy's first start). 0: as before.": {
