      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "ml2280: off (default): an aarch64 program (services.exe, cmd.exe, conhost.exe) started in a session whose first program is 64-bit x86 (ARM64EC) is refused and CreateProcess fails at once. The session's ntdll loads the emulator into it and its threads have no CPU area, so it crashed at its first executable allocation and its exception path faulted until the storm handler ended it (testers' log, 2026-10-28: services.exe started on demand for a launcher installer, twice, 20 s each). A game that needs one starts in the Wine desktop. 1: starts them anyway; MADEIRA_EC_CONHOST=1 still lets conhost.exe through.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
