    "Games download directly from Steam with your account, to this iPhone or to the drive picked under Install on. You can leave Madeira while it downloads: on iOS 26 and later iOS shows the download's progress and keeps it going; on earlier versions it pauses after a short while and continues when you return. A download pauses while a game is running and continues afterwards.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用你的账号直接从 Steam 下载至此 iPhone 或所选安装磁盘。iOS 26 及以上版本支持离开 Madeira 后继续下载并显示进度；较早版本进入后台后会暂停，返回时继续。游戏运行期间会暂停下载，结束后继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
