          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "角色可见距离。较低时速度更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far away grass is drawn. Lower is faster.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "草地绘制距离。较低时速度更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far away objects stay visible. Lower is faster.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "物体可见距离。较低时速度更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far away small items stay visible. Lower is faster.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小型物品的可见距离。较低时速度更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many backup copies of a save are kept when you save over it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "覆盖存档时保留的备份数量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many cells (blocks of world) around you load in full detail. 5 is normal; higher is much slower and can crash.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "周围以完整细节加载的场景区块数量。通常为 5；调高会明显变慢，甚至导致崩溃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many cells away distant trees are drawn.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远处树木的绘制距离，以场景区块计。"
