    "Texture quality: 0 is full, 1 is half size, 2 is a quarter. Higher saves memory and speed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纹理质量：0 为完整尺寸，1 为一半，2 为四分之一。数值越高越节省内存并提高速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture sharpness at an angle (anisotropic filtering), from 0 to 16. Higher looks sharper and costs a little speed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各向异性过滤：改善斜视纹理的清晰度，范围 0–16。数值越高越清晰，但有一定性能开销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DLLs were placed, but reading them back failed. Export the log.": {
