          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可保存在“文件”或 iCloud 云盘中。恢复时会写回文件并覆盖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "which this copy is signed with. Install Madeira again to renew it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此安装正在使用该权限。请重新安装 Madeira 以续签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "your Apple ID's sign-in": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Apple ID 登录凭据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "External StikDebug script": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部 StikDebug 脚本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The external script did not attach within 90 seconds. In StikDebug, assign madeira-jit.js to this Madeira installation and run it, then return to Madeira. Keep the script running until the game starts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部脚本未在 90 秒内附加。请在 StikDebug 中为当前安装的 Madeira 指定 madeira-jit.js 并运行，再返回 Madeira。开始游戏前请保持脚本运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The external script is ready. You can start a game.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部脚本已就绪，可以开始游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the external StikDebug script…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待外部 StikDebug 脚本…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped waiting for the external script.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止等待外部脚本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug runs the script you select. Madeira waits for its attachment and then prepares the game's JIT memory.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由 StikDebug 运行你指定的脚本。Madeira 等待脚本附加，再准备游戏所需的 JIT 内存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Export madeira-jit.js and import it into StikDebug's Scripts page.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 导出 madeira-jit.js，并在 StikDebug 的“脚本”页面导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Assign madeira-jit.js to this Madeira app in StikDebug. Set up this device's pairing and LocalDevVPN there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 在 StikDebug 中为当前 Madeira 指定 madeira-jit.js，并配置此设备的配对文件和 LocalDevVPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Run Madeira from StikDebug with that script, return here, then start your game. Madeira detaches automatically after preparing its JIT memory.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 从 StikDebug 使用该脚本运行 Madeira，返回后再开始游戏。JIT 内存准备完成后，Madeira 会自动解除附加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Madeira JIT script": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出 Madeira JIT 脚本"
